    -- เธฃเธงเธกเธเธนเนเธชเธกเธฑเธเธฃเนเธกเน€เธ”เธฅเธกเธญเธเธชเน€เธ•เธญเธฃเนเธ—เธฑเนเธเธซเธกเธ” (เธ”เธถเธเธเธฒเธเนเธเธฅเน€เธ”เธญเธฃเน NPCs เธเธญเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเธเธฃเธดเธเน€เธ—เนเธฒเธเธฑเนเธ เธเธดเธ”เธเธฒเธฃเธ”เธถเธเธกเธฑเนเธงเธเธฒเธ workspace)
    H.collectEnemyCandidates = function()
        local df = H.dungeonFolder()
        local candidates = {}
        local seen = {}

        local function add(m)
            if m and m:IsA("Model") and not seen[m] and not H.isIgnoredObject(m) then
                seen[m] = true
                table.insert(candidates, m)
            end
        end

        if df then
            -- 1. เนเธเธฅเน€เธ”เธญเธฃเน NPCs เธเธญเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเธเธฃเธดเธ (เธเธธเธ”เธ—เธตเนเธกเธญเธเธชเน€เธ•เธญเธฃเนเธเธญเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเน€เธเธดเธ”เธเธฃเธดเธ: 03_hierarchy.txt:22335)
            local npcs = df:FindFirstChild("NPCs")
            if npcs then
                for _, c in ipairs(npcs:GetChildren()) do add(c) end
            end

            -- 2. เนเธกเน€เธ”เธฅเนเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเธ—เธตเนเธ•เธฃเธเธเธฑเธเธจเธฑเธ•เธฃเธนเธเธฃเธดเธเธซเธฃเธทเธญเธเธญเธช (เธเนเธญเธเธเธฑเธเธกเธญเธ/เธเธญเธชเธ—เธตเนเน€เธเธกเธงเธฒเธเธเธญเธ NPCs folder)
            for _, c in ipairs(df:GetChildren()) do
                if c:IsA("Model") and c ~= npcs and (ValidEnemyNames[c.Name] or (EnemyData and EnemyData[c.Name]) or c:GetAttribute("IsBoss") == true) then
                    add(c)
                end
                -- เธ•เธฃเธงเธเธชเธญเธเธกเธญเธเธชเน€เธ•เธญเธฃเนเธ—เธตเนเธญเธฒเธเน€เธเธดเธ”เธญเธขเธนเนเธเนเธฒเธเนเธเนเธกเน€เธ”เธฅเธซเนเธญเธ (เธชเธณเธซเธฃเธฑเธเธ”เนเธฒเธเธญเธทเนเธเธ—เธตเนเนเธขเธเธกเธญเธเนเธงเนเนเธเธซเนเธญเธ)
                if c:IsA("Model") and c ~= npcs and c.Name:lower():find("room") then
                    local rNpcs = c:FindFirstChild("NPCs")
                    if rNpcs then
                        for _, m in ipairs(rNpcs:GetChildren()) do add(m) end
                    end
                    for _, m in ipairs(c:GetChildren()) do
                        if m:IsA("Model") and (ValidEnemyNames[m.Name] or (EnemyData and EnemyData[m.Name]) or m:GetAttribute("IsBoss") == true or m:HasTag("Enemy")) then
                            add(m)
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end

        return candidates
    end

    -- เธขเธทเธเธขเธฑเธเธงเนเธฒเน€เธเนเธเธกเธญเธเธเธญเธเน€เธเธกเธเธฃเธดเธ (เธ•เธฃเธงเธเธเธฑเธเน€เธเธเธฒเธฐเธจเธฑเธ•เธฃเธนเธเธฃเธดเธ เนเธกเนเธเธฑเธ Dummy/Player/NPC)
    H.isGameEnemy = function(m)
        if not (m and m:IsA("Model")) then return false end
        if Players:GetPlayerFromCharacter(m) then return false end
        if H.isIgnoredObject(m) then return false end

        -- เธ•เนเธญเธเธกเธต Root part เธชเธณเธซเธฃเธฑเธเธงเธฑเธ”เธฃเธฐเธขเธฐเนเธฅเธฐเน€เธฅเนเธเนเธเธกเธ•เธต
        local root = m:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or m.PrimaryPart
        if not root then return false end

        -- Boss เธกเธต attribute IsBoss เน€เธชเธกเธญ
        if m:GetAttribute("IsBoss") == true then return true end

        -- เนเธ—เนเธ Enemy
        if m:HasTag("Enemy") then return true end

        -- เธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเนเธเธฅเน€เธ”เธญเธฃเน NPCs เธเธญเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเธเธฑเธเธเธธเธเธฑเธ
        local df = H.dungeonFolder()
        if df then
            local npcs = df:FindFirstChild("NPCs")
            if npcs and m.Parent == npcs then return true end
        end

        -- เธ•เธฃเธงเธเธชเธญเธเธเธฑเธเธ—เธฐเน€เธเธตเธขเธเธจเธฑเธ•เธฃเธนเธเธฃเธดเธเธเธญเธเน€เธเธก
        if ValidEnemyNames[m.Name] then return true end
        if EnemyData and EnemyData[m.Name] then return true end
        if EnemyManager and EnemyManager.ActiveEnemies and EnemyManager.ActiveEnemies[m] then return true end

        -- เธ•เธดเธ”เธเนเธฒเธขเธเธทเนเธญเนเธฅเธฐเธซเธฅเธญเธ”เน€เธฅเธทเธญเธ” ItemBillboardWithHealth (เน€เธเธเธฒเธฐเน€เธกเธทเนเธญเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธ)
        if df and m:IsDescendantOf(df) and m:FindFirstChild("ItemBillboardWithHealth", true) then
            return true
        end

        -- เธกเธต attribute Dead เนเธชเธ”เธเธงเนเธฒเน€เธเนเธเธกเธญเธเธชเน€เธ•เธญเธฃเนเธเธญเธเน€เธเธดเธฃเนเธเน€เธงเธญเธฃเน (เน€เธเธเธฒเธฐเน€เธกเธทเนเธญเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธ)
        if df and m:IsDescendantOf(df) and m:GetAttribute("Dead") ~= nil then
            return true
        end

        return false
    end

    local function isAlive(m)
        if not (m and m.Parent) then return false end
        if H.isIgnoredObject(m) then return false end

        -- เน€เธเธดเธฃเนเธเน€เธงเธญเธฃเนเธ•เธฑเนเธเธเนเธฒ attribute Dead = true เน€เธกเธทเนเธญเธกเธญเธเธ•เธฒเธข (Weapon_Manager.lua:712)
        if m:GetAttribute("Dead") == true then return false end

        -- เธซเธฒเธเธกเธต Humanoid เธ•เนเธญเธเธกเธตเน€เธฅเธทเธญเธ” > 0
        local h = m:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
        if h and h.Health <= 0 then return false end

        return true
    end

    -- เธเธทเธ list เธกเธญเธเธ—เธฑเนเธเธซเธกเธ”เธ—เธตเนเธกเธตเธเธตเธงเธดเธ•เนเธฅเธฐเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธ (เธฃเธญเธเธฃเธฑเธเธ—เธธเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธ เนเธกเนเธ•เธฑเธ”เธกเธญเธเธ—เธดเนเธ)
    H.liveEnemies = function(rooms)
        local out = {}
        -- Use cache if fresh (1s TTL for enemies - need fresh combat data)
        local now = tick()
        if scanCache.enemies and (now - scanCache.enemiesTick) < 1.0 then
            return scanCache.enemies
        end
        local df = H.dungeonFolder()
        if not df then scanCache.enemies = out; scanCache.enemiesTick = now; return out end
        local candidates = H.collectEnemyCandidates()
        for _, m in ipairs(candidates) do
            if H.isGameEnemy(m) and isAlive(m) then
                local root = m:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or m.PrimaryPart
                if root then
                    local room = H.roomAt(root.Position, rooms)
                    -- เธ–เนเธฒเธญเธขเธนเนเธเธญเธเธฃเธฐเธขเธฐเธซเนเธญเธ เนเธซเนเธเธนเธเธเธฑเธเธซเนเธญเธเธ—เธตเนเนเธเธฅเนเธ—เธตเนเธชเธธเธ” เนเธ•เนเธ•เนเธญเธเนเธกเนเน€เธเธดเธ 150 studs (เนเธกเนเธฃเธฑเธเธ•เธฑเธงเธ—เธตเนเธซเธฅเธธเธ”เนเธเธเธญเธเนเธกเธ)
                    if not room and #rooms > 0 then
                        local bestR, bestD = nil, math.huge
                        for _, r in ipairs(rooms) do
                            local d = (r.Pos - root.Position).Magnitude
                            if d < bestD then bestD, bestR = d, r end
                        end
                        -- Mobs inside the dungeon folder are real targets even when
                        -- they sit outside every room's bounds (e.g. side-chamber
                        -- spawns). Off-map strays keep the old cap and are dropped.
                        -- Off-map strays keep the old cap so they are still dropped.
                        if bestR and (bestD <= CFG.RoomRadius * 1.5 or m:IsDescendantOf(df)) then
                            room = bestR
                        end
                    end
                    -- เธ–เนเธฒเนเธกเนเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเธเธญเธเน€เธเธ•เธซเนเธญเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเนเธ”เน€เธฅเธข (เน€เธเนเธ เธซเธธเนเธเธเธ Baseplate เธซเธฃเธทเธญเธกเธญเธเธ•เธเนเธกเธ) เนเธซเนเธ•เธฑเธ”เธ—เธดเนเธ
                    if room then
                        table.insert(out, {
                            Model = m, Root = root, Room = room,
                            IsBoss = m:GetAttribute("IsBoss") == true
                                or (room and room.IsBoss)
                                or m.Name:lower():find("boss") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("chief") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("king") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("lord") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("gatekeeper") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("warden") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("monarch") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("emperor") ~= nil
                                or m.Name:lower():find("imperator") ~= nil,
                        })
                    end
                end
            end
        end
        scanCache.enemies = out
        scanCache.enemiesTick = tick()
        return out
    end

    -- โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€ Combat โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€
    -- Skill debounce: track last fire time per skill to prevent remote spam
    local skillLastFire = {}  -- [skillKey] = tick()
    local SKILL_DEBOUNCE = 0.1  -- reduced to allow faster spamming

    H.trySkill = function(dir)
        -- Auto Skill: ใช้ skill อัตโนมัติเมื่อ Auto Farm ทำงาน
        if not S.Running then return end
        if CFG.AutoSkillEnabled == false then return end
        if not rSkill then return end
        -- Validate dir is a Vector3 (type enforcement per II.1)
        if typeof(dir) ~= "Vector3" then return end

        -- Create a unique request ID to prevent overlapping skill loops
        S.SkillThreadTick = tick()
        local currentThreadTick = S.SkillThreadTick

        task.spawn(function()
            -- Ultimate (E) - if enabled and ready, use immediately
            if CFG.UseUltimate and LP:GetAttribute("HasUltimate") and LP:GetAttribute("UltimateReady") then
                local lastE = skillLastFire["E"] or 0
                if (tick() - lastE) >= SKILL_DEBOUNCE then
                    skillLastFire["E"] = tick()
                    pcall(function() rSkill:FireServer("E", "tap", dir) end)
                    S._lastCombatAct = tick()
                    task.wait(0.05) -- Slight delay to prevent server from dropping the next skill
                end
            end

            -- Spam all ready skills (user requested faster spam, but we must space them out slightly to bypass server rate limits)
            local keys = CFG.SkillKeys or {"1", "2", "3", "4"}
            local enabled = CFG.EnabledSkills or {true, true, true, true}

            for i, key in ipairs(keys) do
                if not S.Running or S.SkillThreadTick ~= currentThreadTick then return end
                if enabled[i] ~= false and key ~= "E" and key ~= "e" then
                    local skillIdx = tonumber(key)
                    if skillIdx then
                        local base = "Skill" .. skillIdx
                        local charges = LP:GetAttribute(base .. "_Charges")
                        local maxc = LP:GetAttribute(base .. "_MaxCharges")
                        local usable
                        if charges and maxc and maxc > 1 then
                            usable = charges > 0
                        else
                            usable = not LP:GetAttribute(base .. "_OnCooldown")
                        end
                        
                        if usable then
                            local skillKey = tostring(skillIdx)
                            local lastFire = skillLastFire[skillKey] or 0
                            if (tick() - lastFire) >= SKILL_DEBOUNCE then
                                skillLastFire[skillKey] = tick()
                                pcall(function() rSkill:FireServer(skillIdx, "tap", dir) end)
                                S._lastCombatAct = tick()
                                task.wait(0.05) -- Delay between skills so they don't get dropped by server anti-spam
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end)
    end

    -- โ”€โ”€ RenderStepped hover lock: เธฅเนเธญเธเธ•เธฑเธงเธฅเธฐเธเธฃเน€เธซเธเธทเธญเธซเธฑเธงเธกเธญเธเนเธเธเธเธงเนเธณเธซเธเนเธฒ โ”€โ”€
    -- เนเธเน RenderStepped เธ”เธถเธเธ•เธณเนเธซเธเนเธเธ—เธธเธเน€เธเธฃเธก + เธเธญเธเธเธงเนเธณเธซเธเนเธฒเธฅเธ + Velocity=0 + Noclip
    local hoverConn
    local hoverTarget = nil  -- enemy current target
    local hoverHoldPos = nil  -- position to hold when target dies (prevent ground drop)
    local hoverHoldTime = 0   -- time when hold started
    local orbitAngle = 0      -- current orbit angle (radians) for Orbit Below mode

    -- Cache for expensive lookups (refreshed every 0.5s, not every frame)
    -- Prevents GC spikes from GetDescendants/GetExtentsSize/FindFirstChildOfClass
    local hoverCache = {
        rootTick = 0,        -- last time root was refreshed
        cachedRoot = nil,    -- cached current root part
        sizeTick = 0,        -- last time mob size was computed
        cachedSize = 4,      -- cached mob size
        humTick = 0,         -- last time humanoid was checked
        cachedHum = nil,     -- cached humanoid (for dead check)
        cachedDead = false,  -- cached dead state
    }
    local HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL = 0.5  -- refresh interval in seconds

    H.startHoverLock = function()
        if hoverConn then return end
        hoverConn = RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function(deltaTime)
            if not S.Running then return end
            -- Pause hover during respawn (prevents warp to mob while character loading)
            if S.Respawning then return end
            -- If collecting key, pause hover (let key watcher control position)
            if S.KeyCollectBusy and not S.BossRushMode then return end
            -- Telegraph Dodge: หยุด hover ตอนกำลังหลบระเบิด (ไม่ดึงกลับ)
            if S.TelegraphDodgeActive then return end
            -- Boss Dodge: pause hover too (was fighting dodge CFrame every frame)
            if S.BossDodgeBusy then return end
            -- Boss Dodge: ไม่หยุด hover — หลบเป็นแค่ movement ชั่วคราว
            -- hover จะกลับตำแหน่งปกติเองหลัง holdTime
            local r = hrp()
            if not r then return end

            -- Target gone -> hold position in air (DO NOT DROP!)
            if not hoverTarget or not hoverTarget.Root or not hoverTarget.Root.Parent then
                if hoverHoldPos then
                    r.CFrame = hoverHoldPos
                    r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                    r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                end
                return
            end

            -- Cached dead check (refresh every HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL to avoid per-frame FindFirstChildOfClass)
            local now = tick()
            local isDead = false
            if (now - hoverCache.humTick) >= HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL then
                hoverCache.humTick = now
                hoverCache.cachedHum = hoverTarget.Model and hoverTarget.Model:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
                pcall(function() hoverCache.cachedDead = hoverTarget.Model and hoverTarget.Model:GetAttribute("Dead") == true end)
                -- Only check Humanoid HP if Humanoid exists (skip for custom NPC mobs)
                -- In Raid, custom-health entities sit at 0 HP — Dead attribute is authoritative
                local inRaid = S.RaidMode or (RD and RD.inRaid and RD.inRaid())
                if hoverCache.cachedHum and hoverCache.cachedHum.Health <= 0 and not inRaid then
                    hoverCache.cachedDead = true
                end
            end
            isDead = hoverCache.cachedDead

            if isDead then
                if not hoverHoldPos then
                    hoverHoldPos = r.CFrame
                    hoverHoldTime = now
                end
                r.CFrame = hoverHoldPos
                r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                hoverTarget = nil
                -- Reset cache on target switch
                hoverCache.humTick = 0
                hoverCache.rootTick = 0
                hoverCache.sizeTick = 0
                return
            end

            -- Target alive -> clear hold position, follow target
            hoverHoldPos = nil
            hoverHoldTime = 0

            -- Refresh Root part (cached every HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL, not every frame)
            -- This fixes real-time tracking when original Root was a static part
            local currentRoot = nil
            if (now - hoverCache.rootTick) >= HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL then
                hoverCache.rootTick = now
                if hoverTarget.Model and hoverTarget.Model.Parent then
                    currentRoot = hoverTarget.Model:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
                    if not currentRoot then
                        pcall(function() currentRoot = hoverTarget.Model.PrimaryPart end)
                    end
                    if not currentRoot then
                        for _, child in ipairs(hoverTarget.Model:GetDescendants()) do
                            if child:IsA("BasePart") and child.Parent then
                                currentRoot = child; break
                            end
                        end
                    end
                    hoverCache.cachedRoot = currentRoot
                    if currentRoot then hoverTarget.Root = currentRoot end
                else
                    hoverCache.cachedRoot = nil
                end
            else
                currentRoot = hoverCache.cachedRoot
                -- Verify cached root is still valid
                if currentRoot and not currentRoot.Parent then
                    currentRoot = nil
                    hoverCache.cachedRoot = nil
                end
            end
            if not currentRoot then
                -- No root part found — hold position
                if not hoverHoldPos then
                    hoverHoldPos = r.CFrame
                    hoverHoldTime = now
                end
                r.CFrame = hoverHoldPos
                r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                return
            end

            -- Get mob size (cached every HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL to avoid per-frame GetExtentsSize)
            local mobSize = 4
            if (now - hoverCache.sizeTick) >= HOVER_CACHE_INTERVAL then
                hoverCache.sizeTick = now
                if hoverTarget.Model then
                    local ok, bb = pcall(function() return hoverTarget.Model:GetExtentsSize() end)
                    if ok and bb and bb.Y > 0 then mobSize = math.max(bb.Y, 4) end
                    hoverCache.cachedSize = mobSize
                end
            else
                mobSize = hoverCache.cachedSize or 4
            end
            local cfgMode, cfgHeight, cfgFront, cfgOrbitR, cfgOrbitSpd
            if S.RaidMode or (RD and RD.inRaid and RD.inRaid()) then
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_RaidModeSetting or "Behind"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_RaidHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_RaidFront or 8
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_RaidOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_RaidOrbitSpd or 1.0
            elseif S.BossRushMode then
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_BossRushMode or "Orbit"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_BossRushHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_BossRushFront or 8
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_BossRushOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_BossRushOrbitSpd or 1.0
            elseif S.ChallengeMode then
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_ChallengeMode or "Orbit"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_ChallengeHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_ChallengeFront or 0
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_ChallengeOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_ChallengeOrbitSpd or 1.0
                        elseif H.inPayload() then
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_PayloadMode or "Orbit"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_PayloadHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_PayloadFront or 0
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_PayloadOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_PayloadOrbitSpd or 1.0
            elseif CFG.AutoFarmLVL then
                -- Auto Farm LVL
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLMode or "Orbit"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLFront or 0
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLOrbitSpd or 1.0
            else
                -- Dungeon / Endless
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_DungeonMode or "Orbit"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_DungeonHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_DungeonFront or 0
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_DungeonOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_DungeonOrbitSpd or 1.0
            end

            local mode, baseHeight, frontOffset, orbitR_cfg, orbitSpd_cfg
            if CFG.AutoClassMovement and S.resolveClassHeight then
                local classHeight = S.resolveClassHeight()
                if classHeight > 10 then classHeight = 10 end -- Anti-Cheat safety limit (VerticalReachCamp)
                baseHeight = classHeight
                mode = cfgMode
                frontOffset = cfgFront
                orbitR_cfg = cfgOrbitR
                orbitSpd_cfg = cfgOrbitSpd
            else
                baseHeight = cfgHeight
                mode = cfgMode
                frontOffset = cfgFront
                orbitR_cfg = cfgOrbitR
                orbitSpd_cfg = cfgOrbitSpd
            end

            -- Anti-cheat safety: break "sustained hovering" for real.
            -- Server flags VerticalReachCamp after ~5s hovering 15+ studs above a
            -- grounded melee mob ("melee gate unreachable"). Ease DOWN into melee
            -- range and back over ~1.2s every ~4.7s — a smooth ramp resets the
            -- sustained-hover timer and doesn't look like teleport-bouncing.
            local dipPhase = tick() % 4.7
            if dipPhase < 1.2 then
                local k = dipPhase < 0.6 and (dipPhase / 0.6) or ((1.2 - dipPhase) / 0.6)
                baseHeight = 3 + (baseHeight - 3) * (1 - k)
            else
                -- Bob up and down slightly to prevent static altitude flagging
                baseHeight = baseHeight + (math.sin(tick() * 3) * 1.5)
            end
            local heightOffset = baseHeight + (mobSize * 0.15)
            -- Cap sustained hover well under the flagged 15-21 stud range.
            if heightOffset > 10 then
                heightOffset = 9
            end
            -- Race condition guard: verify currentRoot is still valid before using CFrame
            if not currentRoot or not currentRoot.Parent then
                if not hoverHoldPos then
                    hoverHoldPos = r.CFrame
                    hoverHoldTime = now
                end
                r.CFrame = hoverHoldPos
                r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                return
            end
            local targetCFrame = currentRoot.CFrame
            local finalCFrame

            -- Anti-cheat safety: if mob is far below player (different floor), reduce hover height
            -- to avoid VerticalReachCamp flag (sustained hover above grounded melee mob)
            local yDiff = r.Position.Y - currentRoot.Position.Y
            if yDiff > 10 then
                -- Player is too high above mob — lower the hover position
                -- Adjust heightOffset to bring player closer to mob's Y level
                heightOffset = heightOffset - (yDiff - 5)
                if heightOffset < 2 then heightOffset = 2 end
            end

            if mode == "Orbit" then
                -- Orbit: Above + circle around mob
                -- SAFER: do NOT modify mob velocity (server-side detectable)
                -- Instead, just orbit above mob and let M1/skills hit naturally
                -- Use only mob Position (not rotation) so player doesn't spin with mob
                -- deltaTime * 3.0 is approx 0.05 at 60 FPS, maintaining original speed but fps-independent
                orbitAngle = orbitAngle + (orbitSpd_cfg * (deltaTime * 3.0))
                if orbitAngle > math.pi * 2 then orbitAngle = orbitAngle - math.pi * 2 end
                local ox = math.cos(orbitAngle) * orbitR_cfg
                local oz = math.sin(orbitAngle) * orbitR_cfg
                -- Position above mob at orbit radius, angled down to attack (no mob rotation)
                local hoverPos1 = targetCFrame.Position + Vector3.new(ox, heightOffset, oz)
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos1, targetCFrame.Position)
                -- NOTE: Removed mob velocity zeroing (was flag risk - server sees mob physics changed by client)
                -- Mobs will move naturally; player orbits and attacks with M1+skills
            elseif mode == "Behind" then
                -- Behind: หลังบอส (LookVector กลับด้าน) + heightOffset + frontOffset
                local back = -targetCFrame.LookVector
                local behindDist = frontOffset > 0 and frontOffset or (CFG.BossDodgeBehindOffset or 20)
                local hoverPos2 = targetCFrame.Position + Vector3.new(back.X * behindDist, heightOffset, back.Z * behindDist)
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos2, targetCFrame.Position)
            elseif mode == "Front" then
                -- Front: หน้าบอส (LookVector ไปทางเดียวกับบอส) + heightOffset + frontOffset
                local fwd = targetCFrame.LookVector
                local frontDist = frontOffset > 0 and frontOffset or 15
                local hoverPos3 = targetCFrame.Position + Vector3.new(fwd.X * frontDist, heightOffset, fwd.Z * frontDist)
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos3, targetCFrame.Position)
            elseif mode == "Side" then
                -- Side: ด้านข้างบอส (RightVector) + heightOffset + frontOffset
                local right = targetCFrame.RightVector
                local sideDist = frontOffset > 0 and frontOffset or 15
                local hoverPos4 = targetCFrame.Position + Vector3.new(right.X * sideDist, heightOffset, right.Z * sideDist)
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos4, targetCFrame.Position)
            elseif mode == "Outside" then
                -- Outside: วาร์ปไปอยู่ขอบวงโจมตีบอส (นอกวงแต่ชิดขอบ)
                -- วาร์ปตามทิศทางจากบอสไปยังผู้เล่น ที่ระยะที่ตั้งค่าไว้ (default 45 = นอกวง 40)
                local myPos = r.Position
                local bossPos = targetCFrame.Position
                local dir = (myPos - bossPos)
                if dir.Magnitude < 0.1 then
                    -- ถ้าอยู่ใกล้บอสมาก ใช้ LookVector ของบอส
                    dir = targetCFrame.LookVector
                end
                dir = dir.Unit
                local outsideDist = 45
                local hoverPos5 = bossPos + Vector3.new(dir.X * outsideDist, heightOffset, dir.Z * outsideDist)
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos5, targetCFrame.Position)
            elseif mode == "OrbitOutside" then
                -- OrbitOutside: วนรอบบอสที่ระยะนอกวงโจมตี (หลบ Ultimate ที่ติดตาม)
                -- วนรอบเร็วๆ ที่รัศมีใหญ่ เพื่อให้สกิลติดตามตามไม่ทัน
                orbitAngle = orbitAngle + ((orbitSpd_cfg or 1.5) * (deltaTime * 3.0))
                if orbitAngle > math.pi * 2 then orbitAngle = orbitAngle - math.pi * 2 end
                local orbitRadius = 45
                local ox = math.cos(orbitAngle) * orbitRadius
                local oz = math.sin(orbitAngle) * orbitRadius
                local hoverPos6 = targetCFrame.Position + Vector3.new(ox, heightOffset, oz)
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos6, targetCFrame.Position)
            else
                -- "Above" (default): directly above mob head + frontOffset, angled down to attack
                local offset = Vector3.new(0, heightOffset, 0)
                if frontOffset > 0 then
                    local fwd = targetCFrame.LookVector
                    offset = offset + Vector3.new(fwd.X * frontOffset, 0, fwd.Z * frontOffset)
                end
                -- If directly above (no horizontal offset), add small forward offset for diagonal hitbox
                if frontOffset == 0 then
                    local fwd7 = targetCFrame.LookVector
                    offset = offset + Vector3.new(fwd7.X * 4, 0, fwd7.Z * 4)
                end
                local hoverPos7 = targetCFrame.Position + offset
                finalCFrame = CFrame.lookAt(hoverPos7, targetCFrame.Position)
            end

            -- Smooth approach: glide toward the computed hover point at a
            -- capped speed every frame (~280 studs/s). Long-range approaches
            -- look like continuous flight instead of a teleport snap, and
            -- per-frame tracking of the mob stays silky once in range.
            local goalPos = finalCFrame.Position
            local toGoal = goalPos - r.Position
            local goalDist = toGoal.Magnitude
            local maxStep = 280 * deltaTime
            local newPos
            if goalDist <= math.max(maxStep, 1.5) then
                newPos = goalPos
            else
                newPos = r.Position + toGoal.Unit * maxStep
            end
            r.CFrame = (finalCFrame - finalCFrame.Position) + newPos

            -- Zero velocity = no fall, no drift
            r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
            r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero

            -- Noclip: disable CanCollide on all character parts (only if enabled)
            if CFG.Noclip then
                local char = LP.Character
                if char then
                    for _, part in ipairs(char:GetDescendants()) do
                        if part:IsA("BasePart") and part.CanCollide then
                            part.CanCollide = false
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end)
        table.insert(S.Conns, hoverConn)
    end

    stopHoverLock = function()
        if hoverConn then
            pcall(function() hoverConn:Disconnect() end)
            -- Remove from S.Conns to prevent buildup
            if S.Conns then
                for i = #S.Conns, 1, -1 do
                    if S.Conns[i] == hoverConn then
                        table.remove(S.Conns, i)
                        break
                    end
                end
            end
            hoverConn = nil
            
            -- Force upright when hover lock ends
            local r = hrp()
            if r then
                pcall(function()
                    local pos = r.Position
                    r.CFrame = CFrame.new(pos) * CFrame.Angles(0, select(2, r.CFrame:ToEulerAnglesYXZ()), 0)
                end)
            end
        end
        hoverTarget = nil
        hoverHoldPos = nil
        hoverHoldTime = 0
        -- Reset cache
        hoverCache.rootTick = 0
        hoverCache.cachedRoot = nil
        hoverCache.sizeTick = 0
        hoverCache.cachedSize = 4
        hoverCache.humTick = 0
        hoverCache.cachedHum = nil
        hoverCache.cachedDead = false
    end

    local function attack(e)
        local r = hrp()
        if not (r and e.Root and e.Root.Parent) then
            print("[AutoFarm] attack: SKIP - missing root")
            return
        end
        -- Pause combat during respawn (prevents warp-to-mob bug after death)
        if S.Respawning then return end
        if S.KeyCollectBusy and not S.BossRushMode then return end
        -- Telegraph Dodge: หยุด attack ตอนกำลังหลบระเบิด (ไม่วาร์ปกลับไปที่เดิม)
        if S.TelegraphDodgeActive then return end
        -- Boss Dodge: หลบ = หลบอย่างเดียว ไม่ตี (user request)
        if S.BossDodgeBusy then return end
        -- Boss Dodge: ไม่หยุด attack — หลบเป็นแค่ movement ชั่วคราว ยังตี M1 ได้
        H.refreshClassOffset()
        -- Refresh Root part (mob may have moved — get current HumanoidRootPart)
        if e.Model and e.Model.Parent then
            local freshRoot = e.Model:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
            if not freshRoot then
                pcall(function() freshRoot = e.Model.PrimaryPart end)
            end
            if freshRoot and freshRoot.Parent then
                e.Root = freshRoot
            end
        end
        if not (e.Root and e.Root.Parent) then return end
        local tp = e.Root.Position
        local dir

        local eHum = e.Model and e.Model:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
        -- In Boss Rush, bypass Health <= 0 check because milestone bosses might use fake 0 HP for custom health bars
        -- Raid crystals use custom damage too (Humanoid can sit at 0 HP) — bypass as well
        if eHum and eHum.Health <= 0 then 
            if not (S.BossRushMode or S.RaidMode or (RD and RD.inRaid and RD.inRaid())) then return end
        end
        if e.Model and e.Model:GetAttribute("Dead") == true then return end

        if r.Anchored then r.Anchored = false end

        local mobSize = 4
        if e.Model then
            local ok, bb = pcall(function() return e.Model:GetExtentsSize() end)
            if ok and bb and bb.Y > 0 then mobSize = math.max(bb.Y, 4) end
        end
        local cfgMode, cfgHeight, cfgFront, cfgOrbitR, cfgOrbitSpd
        if S.RaidMode or (RD and RD.inRaid and RD.inRaid()) then
            cfgMode = CFG.AF_RaidModeSetting or "Behind"
            cfgHeight = CFG.AF_RaidHeight or 18
            cfgFront = CFG.AF_RaidFront or 8
            cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_RaidOrbitR or 15
        elseif S.BossRushMode then
            cfgMode = CFG.AF_BossRushMode or "Orbit"
            cfgHeight = CFG.AF_BossRushHeight or 18
            cfgFront = CFG.AF_BossRushFront or 8
            cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_BossRushOrbitR or 15
        elseif S.ChallengeMode then
            cfgMode = CFG.AF_ChallengeMode or "Orbit"
            cfgHeight = CFG.AF_ChallengeHeight or 18
            cfgFront = CFG.AF_ChallengeFront or 0
            cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_ChallengeOrbitR or 15
                    elseif H.inPayload() then
                cfgMode = CFG.AF_PayloadMode or "Orbit"
                cfgHeight = CFG.AF_PayloadHeight or 18
                cfgFront = CFG.AF_PayloadFront or 0
                cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_PayloadOrbitR or 15
                cfgOrbitSpd = CFG.AF_PayloadOrbitSpd or 1.0
            elseif CFG.AutoFarmLVL then
            -- Auto Farm LVL
            cfgMode = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLMode or "Orbit"
            cfgHeight = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLHeight or 18
            cfgFront = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLFront or 0
            cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_AutoFarmLVLOrbitR or 15
        else
            -- Dungeon / Endless
            cfgMode = CFG.AF_DungeonMode or "Orbit"
            cfgHeight = CFG.AF_DungeonHeight or 18
            cfgFront = CFG.AF_DungeonFront or 0
            cfgOrbitR = CFG.AF_DungeonOrbitR or 15
        end

        local mode, baseHeight, frontOffset, orbitR_cfg
        if CFG.AutoClassMovement and S.resolveClassHeight then
            local classHeight = S.resolveClassHeight()
            if classHeight > 10 then classHeight = 10 end -- Anti-Cheat safety limit (VerticalReachCamp)
            baseHeight = classHeight
            mode = cfgMode
            frontOffset = cfgFront
            orbitR_cfg = cfgOrbitR
        else
            baseHeight = cfgHeight
            mode = cfgMode
            frontOffset = cfgFront
            orbitR_cfg = cfgOrbitR
        end

        local heightOffset = baseHeight + (mobSize * 0.15)
        -- Anti-cheat safety: cap vertical distance to avoid VerticalReachCamp flag
        -- (flagged at 15-21 studs above grounded melee mobs)
        if heightOffset > 10 then
            heightOffset = 9
        end
        local targetPos
        -- Race condition guard: verify e.Root is still valid before using CFrame
        if not e.Root or not e.Root.Parent then return end
        local targetCFrame = e.Root.CFrame
        -- Compute initial warp position based on AttackPosition mode (use Position only, no mob rotation)
        if mode == "Orbit" then
            -- Orbit: start at orbit radius position, angled down
            local hp = e.Root.Position + Vector3.new(orbitR_cfg, heightOffset, 0)
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        elseif mode == "Behind" then
            local back = -targetCFrame.LookVector
            local behindDist = frontOffset > 0 and frontOffset or (CFG.BossDodgeBehindOffset or 20)
            local hp = e.Root.Position + Vector3.new(back.X * behindDist, heightOffset, back.Z * behindDist)
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        elseif mode == "Front" then
            local fwd = targetCFrame.LookVector
            local frontDist = frontOffset > 0 and frontOffset or 15
            local hp = e.Root.Position + Vector3.new(fwd.X * frontDist, heightOffset, fwd.Z * frontDist)
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        elseif mode == "Side" then
            local right = targetCFrame.RightVector
            local sideDist = frontOffset > 0 and frontOffset or 15
            local hp = e.Root.Position + Vector3.new(right.X * sideDist, heightOffset, right.Z * sideDist)
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        elseif mode == "Outside" then
            -- Outside: วาร์ปไปอยู่ขอบวงโจมตีบอส (นอกวงแต่ชิดขอบ)
            local myRoot = hrp()
            local myPos = myRoot and myRoot.Position or e.Root.Position
            local bossPos = e.Root.Position
            local dir = (myPos - bossPos)
            if dir.Magnitude < 0.1 then
                dir = targetCFrame.LookVector
            end
            dir = dir.Unit
            local outsideDist = 45
            local hp = bossPos + Vector3.new(dir.X * outsideDist, heightOffset, dir.Z * outsideDist)
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        elseif mode == "OrbitOutside" then
            -- OrbitOutside: วนรอบบอสที่รัศมีนอกวงโจมตี (หลบ Ultimate ที่ติดตาม)
            local orbitRadius = 45
            local hp = e.Root.Position + Vector3.new(orbitRadius, heightOffset, 0)
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        else
            -- Above: directly above mob + frontOffset, angled down
            local offset = Vector3.new(0, heightOffset, 0)
            if frontOffset > 0 then
                local fwd = targetCFrame.LookVector
                offset = offset + Vector3.new(fwd.X * frontOffset, 0, fwd.Z * frontOffset)
            end
            if frontOffset == 0 then
                local f7 = targetCFrame.LookVector
                offset = offset + Vector3.new(f7.X * 4, 0, f7.Z * 4)
            end
            local hp = e.Root.Position + offset
            targetPos = CFrame.lookAt(hp, e.Root.Position)
        end
        -- Hand positioning to the hover lock — it glides toward the computed
        -- hover point at a capped per-frame speed. No teleport snap, no blocking
        -- flight, and the attack loop keeps firing the whole way in.
        S.WarpedTarget = e
        hoverHoldPos = nil
        hoverHoldTime = 0
        hoverTarget = e
        H.startHoverLock()

        -- Direction: aim at enemy's current root position (not stale tp)
        -- NaN guard: if positions overlap, use a default direction (down)
        local aimPos = (e.Root and e.Root.Position) or tp
        local diffVec = aimPos - r.Position
        local dist = diffVec.Magnitude
        if dist < 0.001 then
            -- Positions overlap — use default downward direction
            dir = Vector3.new(0, -1, 0)
        else
            dir = diffVec / dist  -- manual Unit (avoids NaN from .Unit on zero vector)
            -- Final NaN check
            if dir.X ~= dir.X or dir.Y ~= dir.Y or dir.Z ~= dir.Z then
                dir = Vector3.new(0, -1, 0)
            end
        end

        -- M1 fire — gated by AutoM1 toggle (synced across ALL modes; warping continues either way)
        if CFG.AutoM1 then
            if not rAttack then H.refreshCombatRemotes() end
            if rAttack then
                pcall(function() rAttack:FireServer(dir) end)
                S._lastCombatAct = tick()
            else
                print("[AutoFarm] attack: rAttack is NIL!")
            end
        end
        H.trySkill(dir)

        local h = hum()
        if h and h.Health > 0 and h.MaxHealth > 0 and (h.Health / h.MaxHealth) < (CFG.PotionThreshold or 0.5) then
            pcall(function() call("PotionService", "UsePotion", 1) end)
        end
    end

    -- โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€ Key Collection System โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€
    -- เธชเนเธเธเธซเธฒ Key เธ—เธตเนเธ”เธฃเธญเธ/เธชเธเธญเธเนเธ workspace เนเธเธเน€เธฃเธตเธขเธฅเนเธ—เธกเน
    -- เน€เธเธกเธเธตเน Key เธ”เธฃเธญเธเธเธฒเธ Chest (DropType="Key") เนเธฅเธฐเธญเธฒเธเธชเธเธญเธเน€เธเนเธ physical item เนเธเธเธฒเธเธเธฃเธ“เธต
    -- เธฃเธฐเธเธเธเธตเนเธ•เธฃเธงเธเธเธฑเธ:
    --   1. Physical key items เนเธ workspace/Debris (เธกเธต "Key" เนเธเธเธทเนเธญ, DropType="Key", เธซเธฃเธทเธญ KeyTier attribute)
    --   2. Locked room doors เธ—เธตเนเธ•เนเธญเธเนเธเน key เน€เธเธดเธ”
    --   3. Data.Keys inventory tracking (T1-T5, Master)

    -- เธ”เธถเธ key inventory เธเธฑเธเธเธธเธเธฑเธเธเธฒเธ PlayerData
    H.refreshKeyInventory = function()
        local pd = H.getPlayerData()
        if pd and pd.Data and pd.Data.Keys then
            S.KeyInventory = pd.Data.Keys
        end
        return S.KeyInventory
    end

    -- เธเธฑเธเธเธณเธเธงเธ key เธ—เธตเนเธกเธตเธ•เธฒเธก tier
    H.getKeyCount = function(tier)
        local keys = H.refreshKeyInventory()
        if not keys then return 0 end
        local keyId = type(tier) == "number" and ("T" .. tostring(tier)) or tostring(tier)
        return keys[keyId] or 0
    end

    -- เธชเนเธเธเธซเธฒ physical key items เนเธ workspace เนเธเธ recursive (เธเนเธเธฅเธถเธเธ—เธธเธเนเธเธฅเน€เธ”เธญเธฃเน)
    -- เน€เธเธทเนเธญเธเธเธฒเธเนเธกเนเธฃเธนเนเธเธทเนเธญ/attribute เธเธฃเธดเธเธเธญเธ key drop -> เธเนเธเธซเธฒเธ—เธธเธ object เธ—เธตเนเธกเธต DropId
    -- เนเธฅเนเธง print เธ—เธธเธเธญเธขเนเธฒเธเธญเธญเธเธกเธฒเน€เธเธทเนเธญ debug เธงเนเธฒ key เธเธฃเธดเธเน เธซเธเนเธฒเธ•เธฒเน€เธเนเธเธขเธฑเธเนเธ
    local scanDebugDone = false  -- print เธฃเธฒเธขเธเธฒเธฃ drop เธ—เธฑเนเธเธซเธกเธ”เธเธฃเธฑเนเธเน€เธ”เธตเธขเธงเน€เธเธทเนเธญ debug
    H.scanForKeyDrops = function()
        local found = {}

        -- เธเธฑเธเธเนเธเธฑเธเธ•เธฃเธงเธเธงเนเธฒ obj เน€เธเนเธ key เธซเธฃเธทเธญเนเธกเน (เธเธฃเธญเธเธเธฅเธธเธกเธ—เธธเธเธเธฃเธ“เธต)
        local function checkIsKey(obj)
            if not obj or not obj.Parent then return false end
            local isPart = obj:IsA("BasePart")
            local isModel = obj:IsA("Model")
            if not (isPart or isModel) then return false end

            local name = obj.Name or ""
            local lower = name:lower()
            local dtype = obj:GetAttribute("DropType")
            local dropId = obj:GetAttribute("DropId")
            local keyTier = obj:GetAttribute("KeyTier")

            -- เธเนเธฒเธกเธซเธตเธเธชเธกเธเธฑเธ•เธด (Chest) เนเธฅเธฐเธซเนเธญเธเธฅเนเธญเธ (Locked) โ€” เนเธกเนเนเธเน key drop
            if lower:find("chest") or lower:find("locked") or lower:find("lock") then
                return false
            end
            -- เธเนเธฒเธกเธ–เนเธฒ parent เน€เธเนเธเธซเนเธญเธ Locked เธซเธฃเธทเธญเธซเธตเธ
            local parentName = obj.Parent and obj.Parent.Name:lower() or ""
            if parentName:find("locked") or parentName:find("chest") or parentName:find("lock") then
                return false
            end

            -- เธงเธดเธเธตเธ—เธตเน 1: DropType = "Key"
            if dtype == "Key" then return true, "DropType=Key" end

            -- เธงเธดเธเธตเธ—เธตเน 2: KeyTier attribute เธกเธตเธเนเธฒ
            if keyTier then return true, "KeyTier=" .. tostring(keyTier) end

            -- เธงเธดเธเธตเธ—เธตเน 3: เธเธทเนเธญเธกเธต "key" (เธเธฃเธญเธ keyboard/keybind/keyframe/keycard)
            if lower:find("key") and not lower:find("keyboard")
                and not lower:find("keybind") and not lower:find("keyframe")
                and not lower:find("keycard") and not lower:find("keypress") then
                -- เธ•เนเธญเธเธกเธต DropId (เน€เธเนเธ drop เธเธฃเธดเธ) เธซเธฃเธทเธญเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเนเธเธฅเน€เธ”เธญเธฃเน Debris/Drops
                if dropId then return true, "Name+DropId" end
                local parentName = obj.Parent and obj.Parent.Name or ""
                if parentName == "Debris" or parentName == "Drops" then return true, "Name+Folder" end
                -- เธซเธฃเธทเธญเธกเธต BillboardGui เธ—เธตเนเธกเธตเธฃเธนเธ key (เนเธญเธเธญเธเธฅเธญเธขเน)
                local bb = obj:FindFirstChildOfClass("BillboardGui") or obj:FindFirstChild("BillboardGui", true)
                if bb then return true, "Name+Billboard" end
            end

            -- เธงเธดเธเธตเธ—เธตเน 4: เธกเธต BillboardGui เธ—เธตเนเธกเธต ImageLabel เธเธทเนเธญเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธงเธเธฑเธ key
            if dropId then
                local bb = obj:FindFirstChildOfClass("BillboardGui") or obj:FindFirstChild("BillboardGui", true)
                if bb then
                    for _, child in ipairs(bb:GetDescendants()) do
                        if child:IsA("ImageLabel") or child:IsA("TextLabel") then
                            local childName = (child.Name or ""):lower()
                            local childText = (child.Text or ""):lower()
                            if childName:find("key") or childText:find("key") then
                                return true, "Billboard+KeyText"
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end

            return false
        end

        -- เธเนเธเธซเธฒเนเธเธ recursive เนเธ workspace เธ—เธฑเนเธเธซเธกเธ”
        -- Search only in Debris folder and dungeon folder (not entire workspace - reduces lag)
        local searchFolders = {}
        local debris = workspace:FindFirstChild("Debris")
        if debris then table.insert(searchFolders, debris) end
        local df = H.dungeonFolder()
        if df then table.insert(searchFolders, df) end

        local seen = {}
        for _, obj in ipairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do
            -- shallow pass at workspace root only (full GetDescendants too heavy at 0.5s)
            seen[obj] = true
            local isKey, source = checkIsKey(obj)
            if isKey then
                local keyPart = obj:IsA("BasePart") and obj or (obj:IsA("Model") and (obj.PrimaryPart or obj:FindFirstChildOfClass("BasePart")))
                if keyPart then
                    table.insert(found, { obj = obj, source = source,
                        tier = obj:GetAttribute("KeyTier") or obj:GetAttribute("Value"),
                        pos = keyPart.Position })
                end
            end
        end
        for _, folder in ipairs(searchFolders) do
            for _, obj in ipairs(folder:GetDescendants()) do
                if not seen[obj] then
                    seen[obj] = true
                    local isKey, source = checkIsKey(obj)
                    if isKey then
                        local keyPart = obj:IsA("BasePart") and obj or (obj:IsA("Model") and (obj.PrimaryPart or obj:FindFirstChildWhichIsA("BasePart")))
                        if keyPart then
                            table.insert(found, {
                                obj = obj,
                                source = source,
                                tier = obj:GetAttribute("KeyTier") or obj:GetAttribute("Value"),
                                pos = keyPart.Position,
                            })
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end

        scanDebugDone = true

        return found
    end

    -- เน€เธเนเธ key drop เธซเธเธถเนเธเธ•เธฑเธง โ€” เธงเธฒเธฃเนเธเนเธเธ—เธฑเธเธ•เธณเนเธซเธเนเธ key เธ•เธฃเธเน
    -- เน€เธเธกเธเธตเน DropSpawner เธกเธตเธฃเธฐเธเธ magnet (เธ”เธนเธ”เน€เธกเธทเนเธญเนเธเธฅเน 15 studs) + collect (เน€เธกเธทเนเธญเนเธเธฅเน 2 studs)
    -- เนเธ•เนเธ–เนเธฒ key เนเธกเนเนเธ”เน spawn เธเนเธฒเธ DropSpawner -> เธ•เนเธญเธเธขเธดเธ DropService.CollectDrop เน€เธญเธ
    -- เธฅเธณเธ”เธฑเธ: เธงเธฒเธฃเนเธเนเธเธ—เธฑเธ -> เธฃเธญ DropSpawner เธ”เธนเธ” -> เธขเธดเธ CollectDrop backup -> เธฃเธญเธเธ key เธซเธฒเธข
    H.collectKeyDrop = function(keyInfo)
        local obj = keyInfo.obj
        if not obj or not obj.Parent then return false end

        -- Check if already collected
        local dropId = obj:GetAttribute("DropId")
        if dropId and S.CollectedKeys[dropId] then return false end

        local r = hrp()
        if not r then return false end

        log(("Key detected! Collecting via remote: %s (source=%s)"):format(obj.Name, keyInfo.source))

        S.KeyCollectBusy = true

        -- Move within pickup range first — firing CollectDrop from far away is
        -- a flag vector (server validates proximity to the drop)
        local kp = keyInfo.pos
        if not kp then
            local okP, pivot = pcall(function() return obj:GetPivot() end)
            kp = okP and pivot and pivot.Position or nil
        end
        if kp and (kp - r.Position).Magnitude > 15 then
            H.warpTo(kp + Vector3.new(0, 2, 0))
            task.wait(0.2)
            r = hrp()
        end

        -- Fire DropService.CollectDrop directly (primary method)
        if dropId then
            local dtype = obj:GetAttribute("DropType") or "Key"
            local dval = obj:GetAttribute("Value") or 1
            local src = obj:GetAttribute("SourceId")
            local mat = obj:GetAttribute("MaterialId")
            pcall(function() call("DropService", "CollectDrop", dropId, dtype, dval, src, mat) end)
        end

        -- Try ProximityPrompt if exists
        local prompt = obj:FindFirstChildOfClass("ProximityPrompt") or obj:FindFirstChild("ProximityPrompt", true)
        if prompt then
            H.triggerPrompt(prompt)
        end

        -- Wait briefly for collection to register
        task.wait(0.3)

        local collected = not obj.Parent or obj.Parent == nil
        if collected then
            if dropId then S.CollectedKeys[dropId] = true end
            log(("Key collected: %s"):format(obj.Name))
        else
            log(("Key collect timeout: %s - continuing farm"):format(obj.Name))
        end

        S.KeyCollectBusy = false
        H.refreshKeyInventory()

        return collected
    end

    -- เธชเนเธเธ + เน€เธเนเธ key เธ—เธฑเนเธเธซเธกเธ”เธ—เธตเนเน€เธเธญเนเธ workspace
    -- เธเธทเธเธเธณเธเธงเธ key เธ—เธตเนเน€เธเนเธเธชเธณเน€เธฃเนเธ
    H.collectAllKeyDrops = function()
        if not CFG.AutoKeyCollect then return 0 end
        if S.KeyCollectBusy then return 0 end

        local keys = H.scanForKeyDrops()
        if #keys == 0 then return 0 end

        log(("Found %d key drop(s) โ€” collecting..."):format(#keys))
        local count = 0
        for _, keyInfo in ipairs(keys) do
            if not S.Running or not inRun() then break end
            if H.collectKeyDrop(keyInfo) then
                count = count + 1
            end
            task.wait(0.2)
        end

        if count > 0 then
            log(("Collected %d key(s) successfully"):format(count))
        end
        return count
    end

    -- โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€ Key Watcher (Room-Cleared mode) โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€โ”€
    -- เธชเนเธเธเธซเธฒ key เนเธเธเน€เธฃเธตเธขเธฅเนเธ—เธกเนเธ—เธธเธ 0.5 เธงเธด เธเธ“เธฐเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธ
    -- เนเธ•เน "เนเธกเนเน€เธเนเธเธ—เธฑเธเธ—เธต" โ€” เธเธ”เธเธณเธ•เธณเนเธซเธเนเธ key เนเธงเน เนเธฅเนเธงเธฃเธญเธเธเธเธงเนเธฒเธซเนเธญเธเธเธฑเธเธเธธเธเธฑเธเธเธฐเน€เธเธฅเธตเธขเธฃเนเธเนเธญเธขเน€เธเนเธ
    -- เธงเธดเธเธตเธเธตเนเนเธกเนเธเธฑเธ”เธเธฑเธเธซเธงเธฐเธเธฒเธฃเธ•เธตเธกเธญเธเธชเน€เธ•เธญเธฃเน
    local keyWatchThread = nil
    local pendingKeys = {}  -- key เธ—เธตเนเน€เธเธญเนเธ•เนเธขเธฑเธเนเธกเนเน€เธเนเธ (เธฃเธญเน€เธเธฅเธตเธขเธฃเนเธซเนเธญเธ)

    H.startKeyWatcher = function()
        if keyWatchThread then return end
        log("Key Watcher started (Room-Cleared mode) โ€” scanning every 0.5s")
        keyWatchThread = task.spawn(function()
            while S.Running and inRun() do
                if CFG.AutoKeyCollect and not S.KeyCollectBusy then
                    -- เธชเนเธเธเธซเธฒ key เนเธ•เน "เธเธ”เธเธณ" เนเธงเน เนเธกเนเน€เธเนเธเธ—เธฑเธเธ—เธต
                    local keys = H.scanForKeyDrops()
                    if #keys > 0 then
                        for _, keyInfo in ipairs(keys) do
                            -- เน€เธเธดเนเธก key เธ—เธตเนเน€เธเธญเน€เธเนเธฒ pending list (เธ–เนเธฒเธขเธฑเธเนเธกเนเธกเธต)
                            local alreadyPending = false
                            for _, pk in ipairs(pendingKeys) do
                                if pk.obj == keyInfo.obj then
                                    alreadyPending = true
                                    break
                                end
                            end
                            if not alreadyPending then
                                table.insert(pendingKeys, keyInfo)
                                log(("Key Watcher: key detected (pending) โ€” %s at %s โ€” will collect after room cleared"):format(
                                    keyInfo.obj.Name, tostring(keyInfo.pos)))
                            end
                        end
                    end

                    -- เน€เธเนเธเธงเนเธฒเธซเนเธญเธเธเธฑเธเธเธธเธเธฑเธเน€เธเธฅเธตเธขเธฃเนเนเธฅเนเธง เนเธฅเธฐเธกเธต pending keys -> เน€เธเนเธเน€เธฅเธข
                    -- เนเธเน S.ProbeRoom เธ—เธตเน farmLoop เธญเธฑเธเน€เธ”เธ•เธญเธขเธนเนเธ•เธฅเธญเธ”เน€เธงเธฅเธฒ
                    local roomCleared = false
                    if S.ProbeRoom and S.Cleared[S.ProbeRoom] then
                        roomCleared = true
                    end
                    -- fallback: เธ–เนเธฒเนเธกเนเธกเธตเธกเธญเธเธชเน€เธ•เธญเธฃเนเธญเธขเธนเนเนเธเธฅเน -> เธ–เธทเธญเธงเนเธฒเธเธฅเธญเธ”เธ เธฑเธขเธ—เธตเนเธเธฐเน€เธเนเธ
                    if not roomCleared then
                        local r = hrp()
                        if r then
                            local hasNearbyEnemy = false
                            local rooms = H.orderedRooms()
                            for _, e in ipairs(H.liveEnemies(rooms)) do
                                if e.Root and e.Root.Parent and isAlive(e.Model) then
                                    if (e.Root.Position - r.Position).Magnitude < 30 then
                                        hasNearbyEnemy = true
                                        break
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                            if not hasNearbyEnemy then
                                roomCleared = true
                            end
                        end
                    end

                    if #pendingKeys > 0 and roomCleared then
                        log(("Key Watcher: room cleared โ€” collecting %d pending key(s)"):format(#pendingKeys))
                        stopHoverLock()
                        S.KeyCollectBusy = true
                        local remaining = {}
                        for _, keyInfo in ipairs(pendingKeys) do
                            if not S.Running or not inRun() then break end
                            if keyInfo.obj and keyInfo.obj.Parent then
                                H.collectKeyDrop(keyInfo)
                                task.wait(0.1)
                            end
                        end
                        pendingKeys = {}  -- เน€เธเธฅเธตเธขเธฃเน pending list เธซเธฅเธฑเธเน€เธเนเธเธซเธกเธ”
                        S.KeyCollectBusy = false
                        H.refreshKeyInventory()
                        log("Key Watcher: pending keys collected โ€” resuming combat")
                    end
                end
                task.wait(0.5)
            end
        end)
    end

    H.stopKeyWatcher = function()
        if keyWatchThread then
            pcall(function() task.cancel(keyWatchThread) end)
            keyWatchThread = nil
        end
        pendingKeys = {}
    end

    -- เธเธฑเธเธเธฑเธเน€เธเนเธ pending keys เธ—เธฑเนเธเธซเธกเธ”เธ—เธฑเธเธ—เธต (เนเธเนเธ•เธญเธเธเธเธ”เธฑเธเน€เธเธตเนเธขเธเธเนเธญเธเธญเธญเธ)
    H.flushPendingKeys = function()
        if #pendingKeys == 0 then return end
        log(("Flushing %d pending key(s) before exit"):format(#pendingKeys))
        stopHoverLock()
        S.KeyCollectBusy = true
        for _, keyInfo in ipairs(pendingKeys) do
            if not S.Running or not inRun() then break end
            if keyInfo.obj and keyInfo.obj.Parent then
                H.collectKeyDrop(keyInfo)
                task.wait(0.1)
            end
        end
        pendingKeys = {}
        S.KeyCollectBusy = false
        H.refreshKeyInventory()
    end

    -- =====================================================================
    -- Auto Potion Watcher (Real-time HP check)
    -- =====================================================================
    -- เธ•เธฃเธงเธเธเธฑเธ Potion_Station เนเธ dungeon เนเธฅเธฐ warp เนเธเน€เธ•เธดเธกเนเธเธเธฑเนเธเน€เธกเธทเนเธญเธซเธกเธ”

    H.getEquippedPotionId = function()
        -- fallback: เธญเนเธฒเธเธเธฒเธ PlayerData.Data.EquippedPotion
        local pd = H.getPlayerData()
        if pd and pd.Data and pd.Data.EquippedPotion then
            return pd.Data.EquippedPotion
        end
        -- fallback: เนเธเนเนเธเธเธฑเนเธเนเธฃเธเธ—เธตเนเธกเธตเนเธ inventory
        if pd and pd.Data and pd.Data.Potions then
            for id, count in pairs(pd.Data.Potions) do
                if count and count > 0 then return id end
            end
        end
        return nil
    end

    H.getPotionCount = function()
        local pd = H.getPlayerData()
        if not pd or not pd.Data or not pd.Data.Potions then return 0 end
        local potionId = H.getEquippedPotionId()
        if not potionId then return 0 end
        local count = pd.Data.Potions[potionId] or 0
        -- เธเธฑเธเธฃเธงเธกเธ—เธธเธเนเธเธเธฑเนเธเธ–เนเธฒเนเธกเนเน€เธเธญ equipped
        if count == 0 then
            local total = 0
            for _, n in pairs(pd.Data.Potions) do
                total = total + (n or 0)
            end
            return total
        end
        return count
    end

    -- =====================================================================
    -- Auto Potion Watcher (Real-time HP check)
    -- =====================================================================
    local potionWatchThread = nil
    local lastPotionUse = 0

    H.startPotionWatcher = function()
        if potionWatchThread then return end
        log(("Potion Watcher started - HP check every 0.5s (threshold: %d%%)"):format(
            math.floor((CFG.PotionThreshold or 0.5) * 100)))
        potionWatchThread = task.spawn(function()
            while S.Running and inRun() do
                -- Potion Heal: use potion when HP below threshold
                if CFG.AutoPotion then
                    local h = hum()
                    if h and h.Health > 0 and h.MaxHealth > 0 then
                        local potCount = H.getPotionCount()
                        
                        -- 1. If we are completely out of potions, try to refill FIRST (regardless of HP)
                        if potCount <= 0 then
                            if not S.AltarBusy and (tick() - lastPotionUse) >= 3.0 then
                                lastPotionUse = tick()
                                local pStation = H.findPotionStation()
                                if pStation then
                                    S.AltarBusy = true
                                    log("Out of potions! Warping to Potion_Station to refill")
                                    local ok = H.warpAndTrigger(pStation)
                                    if ok then
                                        task.wait(2.0)
                                        log("Potion refilled successfully!")
                                    else
                                        log("Failed to trigger Potion_Station!")
                                    end
                                    S.AltarBusy = false
                                else
                                    -- Out of potions and no Potion_Station found (only log if HP is low)
                                    local hpRatio = h.Health / h.MaxHealth
                                    if hpRatio < (CFG.PotionThreshold or 0.5) and (tick() - lastPotionUse) >= 5.0 then
                                        lastPotionUse = tick()
                                        log("Auto Potion: HP low but out of potions AND no Potion_Station found!")
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        else
                            -- 2. We have potions, check HP threshold
                            local hpRatio = h.Health / h.MaxHealth
                            if hpRatio < (CFG.PotionThreshold or 0.5) then
                                if (tick() - lastPotionUse) >= 1.0 then
                                    lastPotionUse = tick()
                                    log(("Auto Potion: HP %.0f/%.0f (%.0f%%) < %d%% - using potion (Left: %d)"):format(
                                        h.Health, h.MaxHealth, hpRatio * 100,
                                        math.floor((CFG.PotionThreshold or 0.5) * 100), potCount))
                                    pcall(function() call("PotionService", "UsePotion", 1) end)
                                end
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end

                task.wait(0.5)
            end
        end)
    end

    H.stopPotionWatcher = function()
        if potionWatchThread then
            pcall(function() task.cancel(potionWatchThread) end)
            potionWatchThread = nil
        end
    end

    -- =====================================================================
    -- Auto Boss Dodge (skill-specific dodge based on Boss_ActionData)
    -- =====================================================================
    -- ตรวจจับสกิลบอสผ่าน Animator.AnimationPlayed + แมพกับ Boss_ActionData
    -- เลือกตำแหน่งหลบตาม HitboxSize.Y:
    --   Y >= BossDodgeHighY (>=30) -> Under  (จมดินใต้บอส ติดๆ)
    --   Y <= BossDodgeLowY  (<=15) -> Above (กระโดดเหนือบอส)
    --   กลางๆ                    -> Orbit/Side/Behind/Between
    -- สัมพันธ์กับ Auto M1: หยุด hover/attack ตอนหลบ แล้วกลับเลย
    -- =====================================================================

    -- โหลด Boss_ActionData (lazy require — อาจไม่มีในบางเกม)
    local BossActionData = nil
    H.getBossActionData = function()
        if BossActionData ~= nil then return BossActionData end
        local ok, mod = pcall(function()
            local rs = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
            local gi = rs:FindFirstChild("GameInfo")
            if not gi then return nil end
            local bad = gi:FindFirstChild("Boss_ActionData")
            if not bad then return nil end
            return require(bad)
        end)
        if ok and type(mod) == "table" then
            BossActionData = mod
            return mod
        end
        BossActionData = false  -- cache negative
        return false
    end

    -- โหลด skill module เพื่ออ่าน AnimationName (lazy + cached)
    local skillModuleCache = {}
    H.getSkillAnimationName = function(classSource, moduleName)
        local key = (classSource or "?") .. "/" .. (moduleName or "?")
        if skillModuleCache[key] ~= nil then return skillModuleCache[key] end
        local result = nil
        pcall(function()
            local rs = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
            local gi = rs:FindFirstChild("GameInfo")
            if not gi then return end
            local ba = gi:FindFirstChild("Boss_Abilities")
            if not ba then return end
            local classFolder = ba:FindFirstChild(classSource)
            if not classFolder then return end
            local mod = classFolder:FindFirstChild(moduleName)
            if not mod then return end
            local ok, data = pcall(function() return require(mod) end)
            if ok and type(data) == "table" and data.AnimationName then
                result = data.AnimationName
            end
        end)
        skillModuleCache[key] = result  -- nil = ไม่เจอ, string = ชื่อ animation
        return result
    end

    -- สร้าง skill map จาก Boss_ActionData: { [AnimationName] = {ModuleName, HitboxSize, TelegraphType, TelegraphDuration, ...} }
    -- รองรับ abilities ที่มี AnimName override และที่ใช้ AnimationName จาก skill module
    H.buildBossSkillMap = function(bossName)
        local bad = H.getBossActionData()
        if not bad or not bad.Resolve then return {} end
        local ok, data = pcall(function() return bad:Resolve(bossName) end)
        if not ok or type(data) ~= "table" then return {} end
        local classSource = data.ClassSource
        local abilities = data.Abilities
        if type(abilities) ~= "table" then return {} end
        local skillMap = {}
        for _, ab in ipairs(abilities) do
            if type(ab) == "table" and ab.ModuleName then
                -- หา AnimationName: ใช้ AnimName override ก่อน, ถ้าไม่มีดึงจาก skill module
                local animName = ab.AnimName
                if not animName then
                    animName = H.getSkillAnimationName(classSource, ab.ModuleName)
                end
                if animName then
                    skillMap[animName] = {
                        ModuleName = ab.ModuleName,
                        HitboxSize = ab.HitboxSize or data.DefaultHitboxSize,
                        TelegraphType = ab.TelegraphType or "AoE",
                        TelegraphDuration = ab.TelegraphDuration or 1.0,
                        TelegraphRange = ab.TelegraphRange or ab.TelegraphRadius or 20,
                        PhaseGate = ab.PhaseGate,
                        ActivePhases = ab.ActivePhases,
                    }
                end
            end
        end
        return skillMap
    end

    -- Forward declaration: findBossRushBoss (define ทีหลัง แต่ scanner ต้องใช้)
    local findBossRushBoss

    -- หา boss จาก liveEnemies (ใช้ระบบเดียวกับ Auto M1 — พิสูจน์แล้วว่าเจอบอส)
    -- ใน Boss Rush ถ้า liveEnemies ว่าง ให้ fallback scan workspace หา model ที่เป็นบอส
    H.findBossFromLiveEnemies = function()
        -- 1. ลองจาก liveEnemies ก่อน (ระบบเดียวกับ Auto M1)
        local rooms = H.orderedRooms()
        for _, e in ipairs(H.liveEnemies(rooms)) do
            if e.IsBoss and e.Root and e.Root.Parent and isAlive(e.Model) then
                return e
            end
        end
        -- 2. Fallback: หา model ที่ชื่อตรงกับ bossDodgeBossName (จาก BossHealthUpdate)
        -- Fallback scans: search dungeon folder + BossRush_NPCs + workspace root only
        -- (full workspace:GetDescendants() every 0.25s was a major FPS killer)
        local searchScopes = {}
        local dfScope = H.dungeonFolder()
        if dfScope then table.insert(searchScopes, dfScope) end
        local brNpc = workspace:FindFirstChild("BossRush_NPCs")
        if brNpc then table.insert(searchScopes, brNpc) end
        local function iterBossModels(fn)
            for _, scope in ipairs(searchScopes) do
                for _, m in ipairs(scope:GetDescendants()) do
                    if fn(m) then return true end
                end
            end
            for _, m in ipairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do
                if m:IsA("Model") and fn(m) then return true end
            end
            return false
        end
        if bossDodgeBossName then
            local hit = nil
            iterBossModels(function(m)
                if m:IsA("Model") and m.Name == bossDodgeBossName then
                    local root = m:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or m.PrimaryPart
                    if root and root.Parent and isAlive(m) then
                        hit = { Model = m, Root = root, IsBoss = true }
                        return true
                    end
                end
                return false
            end)
            if hit then return hit end
        end
        -- 3. Fallback: scan workspace หา model ที่มี IsBoss attribute หรือชื่อมี boss keywords
        local hit2 = nil
        iterBossModels(function(m)
            if m:IsA("Model") and isAlive(m) then
                local isBoss = m:GetAttribute("IsBoss") == true
                if not isBoss then
                    local n = m.Name:lower()
                    if n:find("boss") or n:find("chief") or n:find("king") or n:find("lord")
                    or n:find("gatekeeper") or n:find("warden") or n:find("monarch")
                    or n:find("emperor") or n:find("imperator") then
                        isBoss = true
                    end
                end
                if isBoss then
                    local root = m:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or m.PrimaryPart
                    if root and root.Parent then
                        hit2 = { Model = m, Root = root, IsBoss = true }
                        return true
                    end
                end
            end
            return false
        end)
        return hit2
    end

    -- ตรวจจับ AOE ของบอส — ตรวจ FX_Activate + telegraph parts ใน boss model + workspace
    -- หา AoE/telegraph parts จริง — คืน list ของ {Part, Pos, Radius}
    -- ใช้สำหรับคำนวณตำแหน่งหลบนอกรัศมี AoE
    -- Functions defined inside do block below use global `function name()` syntax
    -- so they're visible everywhere without forward declarations (saves top-level locals)
    do
    local AOE_NAME_PAT = "telegraph|aoe|ring|warning|indicator|circle|spell|zone|area|sigil|oblivion|umbral|grave|nightfall|collapse|bolt|crush"
    H.findAOEParts = function(bossModel, bossRoot)
        local parts = {}
        local function tryAdd(part)
            if not (part and part:IsA("BasePart") and part.Parent) then return end
            local n = (part.Name or ""):lower()
            local matched = false
            if n:match(AOE_NAME_PAT) then matched = true end
            if part:GetAttribute("FX_Activate") == true then matched = true end
            if not matched then return end
            if part.Transparency >= 0.95 then return end
            -- กรอง Line telegraph ออก — เก็บแค่ AoE (วงกลม)
            -- Line: Size ยาวมากด้านเดียว (X หรือ Z ใหญ่กว่าอีกด้าน 3 เท่าขึ้นไป)
            local sx, sz = part.Size.X, part.Size.Z
            local ratio = math.max(sx, sz) / math.min(sx, sz)
            if ratio >= 3.0 then return end  -- เป็น Line ไม่เอา
            -- คำนวณรัศมีจาก Size (ใช้ X/Z ที่ใหญ่กว่า)
            local radius = math.max(sx, sz) * 0.5
            if radius < 2 then radius = 12 end  -- fallback ถ้า Size เล็กเกินไป
            table.insert(parts, { Part = part, Pos = part.Position, Radius = radius })
        end

        -- 1. ใน boss model
        if bossModel then
            for _, child in ipairs(bossModel:GetDescendants()) do
                pcall(tryAdd, child)
            end
        end
        -- 2. workspace.SpellTelegraphs
        local st = workspace:FindFirstChild("SpellTelegraphs")
        if st then
            for _, child in ipairs(st:GetDescendants()) do
                pcall(tryAdd, child)
            end
        end
        -- 3. ใกล้บอสใน workspace (80 studs)
        if bossRoot then
            local bossPos = bossRoot.Position
            -- Only descend containers whose name hints at effects/telegraphs
            -- (descending EVERY workspace child each scan was a major FPS killer)
            local SCOPE_PAT = "telegraph|aoe|fx|effect|spell|debris|hazard|skill|projectile|vfx|drop"
            for _, child in ipairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do
                if child ~= bossModel and (child:IsA("Model") or child:IsA("Folder")) then
                    local cn = (child.Name or ""):lower()
                    if cn:match(SCOPE_PAT) then
                        for _, desc in ipairs(child:GetDescendants()) do
                            if desc:IsA("BasePart") then
                                local n = (desc.Name or ""):lower()
                                if (n:match(AOE_NAME_PAT) or desc:GetAttribute("FX_Activate") == true)
                                and desc.Transparency < 0.95 then
                                    local dist = (desc.Position - bossPos).Magnitude
                                    if dist < 80 then
                                        pcall(tryAdd, desc)
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        end
                    else
                        -- shallow check: direct children only (covers loose telegraph parts)
                        for _, desc in ipairs(child:GetChildren()) do
                            if desc:IsA("BasePart") then
                                local n = (desc.Name or ""):lower()
                                if (n:match(AOE_NAME_PAT) or desc:GetAttribute("FX_Activate") == true)
                                and desc.Transparency < 0.95 then
                                    local dist = (desc.Position - bossPos).Magnitude
                                    if dist < 80 then
                                        pcall(tryAdd, desc)
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
        return parts
    end

    H.bossHasAOE = function(bossModel, bossRoot)
        local parts = H.findAOEParts(bossModel, bossRoot)
        return #parts > 0
    end

    -- ตรวจจับสัญญาณสกิลบอส — ต้องมี AOE จริงหรือ FX_Activate จริงเท่านั้น
    -- ไม่หลบจาก animation ธรรมดา (เดิมหลบรัวๆ)
    -- คืน: isCasting, hasAOE, hitboxY (estimated)
    H.detectBossSkill = function(bossEntry, skillMap)
        if not bossEntry or not bossEntry.Model or not bossEntry.Model.Parent then
            return false, false, 10
        end
        local model = bossEntry.Model
        local root = bossEntry.Root
        local hasAOE = false
        local hitboxY = 10  -- default
        local hasRealSignal = false  -- ต้องมีสัญญาณจริง (AOE/FX/Dash)

        -- Signal 1: BossSkillDash BodyVelocity (สัญญาณจริง — dash attack)
        if root and root:FindFirstChild("BossSkillDash") then
            hasRealSignal = true
        end

        -- Signal 2: FX_Activate attribute บน FX parts (สัญญาณจริง)
        local fxFolder = model:FindFirstChild("FX")
        if fxFolder then
            for _, fxPart in ipairs(fxFolder:GetDescendants()) do
                if fxPart:IsA("BasePart") and fxPart:GetAttribute("FX_Activate") == true then
                    hasRealSignal = true
                    break
                end
            end
        end
        if not hasRealSignal then
            for _, desc in ipairs(model:GetDescendants()) do
                if desc:IsA("BasePart") and desc:GetAttribute("FX_Activate") == true then
                    hasRealSignal = true
                    break
                end
            end
        end

        -- Signal 3: AOE ring/effect/telegraph (สัญญาณจริง)
        local aoeParts = H.findAOEParts(model, root)
        hasAOE = #aoeParts > 0
        if hasAOE then
            hasRealSignal = true
        end

        -- Signal 4: Animator playing animation — ใช้เพื่อหา hitboxY + TelegraphType
        local currentTelegraphType = nil  -- เก็บ TelegraphType ของสกิลที่กำลังเล่น
        if skillMap then
            local animator = nil
            local hum = model:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
            if hum then
                animator = hum:FindFirstChildOfClass("Animator")
            end
            if not animator then
                local animCtrl = model:FindFirstChildOfClass("AnimationController")
                if animCtrl then
                    animator = animCtrl:FindFirstChildOfClass("Animator")
                end
            end
            if animator then
                for _, track in ipairs(animator:GetPlayingAnimationTracks()) do
                    if track.IsPlaying then
                        local animName = track.Name
                        if not animName and track.Animation then
                            animName = track.Animation.Name
                        end
                        if animName and skillMap[animName] then
                            local entry = skillMap[animName]
                            if entry.HitboxSize and typeof(entry.HitboxSize) == "Vector3" then
                                hitboxY = entry.HitboxSize.Y
                            end
                            currentTelegraphType = entry.TelegraphType or "AoE"
                            break
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end

        -- ถ้ามี AOE ให้ assume hitbox Y สูง (AoE มักตีโดนบนฟ้า)
        if hasAOE and hitboxY == 10 then
            hitboxY = 30  -- default สำหรับ AOE
        end

        -- หลบเฉพาะเมื่อมี AoE วงกลมเท่านั้น (ไม่หลบ Line/ทางตรง/FX/Dash)
        -- hasRealSignal = hasAOE เท่านั้น
        hasRealSignal = hasAOE

        -- คืน: isCasting, hasAOE, hitboxY, aoeParts (list ของ AoE parts จริง)
        return hasRealSignal, hasAOE, hitboxY, aoeParts
    end

    -- == ตำแหน่งหลบ (Dodge Position Helpers) ==
    -- Under: ใต้บอส ติดๆ จมดินได้ (Y -= offset)
    H.dodgePos_Under = function(bossRoot, offset)
        offset = offset or CFG.BossDodgeUnderOffset or 3.0
        return bossRoot.Position + Vector3.new(0, -offset, 0)
    end

    -- Above: เหนือบอส (Y += offset) — ใช้ระยะ hover ตาม config
    H.dodgePos_Above = function(bossRoot, offset)
        -- ใช้ระยะ hover ตาม config (เดียวกับ Auto M1) ไม่ใช่ค่าคงที่
        if not offset then
            offset = S.BossRushMode and (CFG.BossRushAttackHeight or 12.0) or (CFG.AboveHeight or 8.0)
            offset = offset + 5  -- เพิ่มนิดหน่อยให้สูงกว่า hover ปกติ
        end
        return bossRoot.Position + Vector3.new(0, offset, 0)
    end

    -- Side: ด้านข้างบอส (X offset)
    H.dodgePos_Side = function(bossRoot, offset)
        offset = offset or CFG.BossDodgeSideOffset or 25
        -- ด้านข้าง = ตั้งฉากกับ LookVector
        local right = bossRoot.CFrame.RightVector
        return bossRoot.Position + right * offset
    end

    -- Behind: หลังบอส (LookVector กลับด้าน)
    H.dodgePos_Behind = function(bossRoot, offset)
        offset = offset or CFG.BossDodgeBehindOffset or 20
        local back = -bossRoot.CFrame.LookVector
        return bossRoot.Position + back * offset
    end

    -- Between: ระหว่างบอสกับเรา (กลางทาง)
    H.dodgePos_Between = function(bossRoot, myPos)
        local mid = (bossRoot.Position + myPos) * 0.5
        return mid
    end

    -- Orbit: วงโคจรรอบบอส (อัปเดตมุมทีละนิด)
    H.dodgePos_Orbit = function(bossRoot, radius, angle)
        radius = radius or CFG.BossDodgeOrbitRadius or 30
        local ox = math.cos(angle) * radius
        local oz = math.sin(angle) * radius
        return bossRoot.Position + Vector3.new(ox, 0, oz)
    end

    -- AoESide: หลบออกจากรัศมี AoE — วาร์ปไปด้านข้างนอก AoE ไม่ให้โดน
    -- หา AoE ที่ใกล้เราที่สุด → เดินออกจากตัว AoE ไปนอกรัศมี + margin
    local AOE_DODGE_MARGIN = 20  -- ระยะห่างเพิ่มจากรัศมี AoE (studs) — เผื่อ hitbox ใหญ่
    H.dodgePos_AOESide = function(aoeParts, myPos, bossRoot)
        if not aoeParts or #aoeParts == 0 then return nil end
        -- หา AoE ที่ใกล้เราที่สุด (อันตรายที่สุด)
        local closest = nil
        local closestDist = math.huge
        for _, aoe in ipairs(aoeParts) do
            local d = (aoe.Pos - myPos)
            d = Vector3.new(d.X, 0, d.Z).Magnitude  -- ระยะแนวราบ
            if d < closestDist then
                closestDist = d
                closest = aoe
            end
        end
        if not closest then return nil end

        -- ทิศจาก AoE center → ตัวเรา (เดินออกไปทางนี้)
        local dir = myPos - closest.Pos
        dir = Vector3.new(dir.X, 0, dir.Z)
        if dir.Magnitude < 0.1 then
            -- เราอยู่กลาง AoE พอดี — เลือกทิศจากบอสแทน
            if bossRoot then
                dir = myPos - bossRoot.Position
                dir = Vector3.new(dir.X, 0, dir.Z)
            end
            if dir.Magnitude < 0.1 then
                dir = Vector3.new(1, 0, 0)  -- default ไปทาง +X
            end
        end
        dir = dir.Unit

        -- ตำแหน่งปลอดภัย: ห่างจาก AoE center ออกไป (radius + margin)
        local safeDist = closest.Radius + AOE_DODGE_MARGIN
        local safePos = closest.Pos + dir * safeDist
        -- รักษา Y เดิม (ไม่บินขึ้น/ไม่จมดิน)
        safePos = Vector3.new(safePos.X, myPos.Y, safePos.Z)

        -- ถ้ายังอยู่ใน AoE อื่นอีก → ขยับออกจากอันนั้นด้วย
        for _, aoe in ipairs(aoeParts) do
            if aoe ~= closest then
                local d = safePos - aoe.Pos
                d = Vector3.new(d.X, 0, d.Z).Magnitude
                if d < aoe.Radius + AOE_DODGE_MARGIN then
                    local awayDir = safePos - aoe.Pos
                    awayDir = Vector3.new(awayDir.X, 0, awayDir.Z)
                    if awayDir.Magnitude < 0.1 then awayDir = dir end
                    safePos = aoe.Pos + awayDir.Unit * (aoe.Radius + AOE_DODGE_MARGIN)
                    safePos = Vector3.new(safePos.X, myPos.Y, safePos.Z)
                end
            end
        end
        return safePos
    end

    -- เลือกตำแหน่งหลบอัตโนมัติจาก HitboxSize.Y
    -- ถ้ามี aoeParts → ใช้ AoESide หลบออกจากรัศมี AoE ก่อนเสมอ (ยกเว้น mode ที่ผู้ใช้เลือกเอง)
    -- คืน: position (Vector3), modeName (string)
    H.chooseDodgePosition = function(bossRoot, myPos, hitboxY, skillMap_entry, aoeParts)
        local mode = CFG.BossDodgeMode or "Auto"
        local highY = CFG.BossDodgeHighY or 30
        local lowY = CFG.BossDodgeLowY or 15

        -- ถ้ามี AoE จริง → หลบออกจากรัศมี AoE ก่อนเสมอ (ยกเว้นผู้ใช้เลือก mode เฉพาะเจาะจง)
        if aoeParts and #aoeParts > 0 and (mode == "Auto" or mode == "AoESide") then
            local safePos = H.dodgePos_AOESide(aoeParts, myPos, bossRoot)
            if safePos then return safePos, "AoESide" end
        end

        if mode == "Under" then
            return H.dodgePos_Under(bossRoot), "Under"
        elseif mode == "Above" then
            return H.dodgePos_Above(bossRoot), "Above"
        elseif mode == "Side" then
            return H.dodgePos_Side(bossRoot), "Side"
        elseif mode == "Behind" then
            return H.dodgePos_Behind(bossRoot), "Behind"
        elseif mode == "Between" then
            return H.dodgePos_Between(bossRoot, myPos), "Between"
        elseif mode == "Orbit" then
            S.BossDodgeOrbitAngle = S.BossDodgeOrbitAngle + 0.5
            return H.dodgePos_Orbit(bossRoot), "Orbit"
        elseif mode == "AoESide" then
            -- ผู้ใช้เลือก AoESide แต่ไม่มี AoE → fallback ไป Behind
            return H.dodgePos_Behind(bossRoot), "Behind"
        end

        -- Auto: เลือกตาม HitboxSize.Y
        if hitboxY >= highY then
            -- สกิลตีโดนบนฟ้าสูง -> หลบ Under (จมดินใต้บอส ติดๆ)
            return H.dodgePos_Under(bossRoot), "Under"
        elseif hitboxY <= lowY then
            -- สกิลตีพื้น/ต่ำ -> หลบ Above (กระโดดเหนือบอส)
            return H.dodgePos_Above(bossRoot), "Above"
        else
            -- กลางๆ -> หลบ Behind (ปลอดภัยสุดสำหรับ hitbox กลาง)
            return H.dodgePos_Behind(bossRoot), "Behind"
        end
    end

    -- ทำการหลบ: วาร์ปไปตำแหน่งหลบ + รอ + กลับ
    -- สัมพันธ์กับ Auto M1: หยุด hover ตอนหลบ แล้วค่อยกลับ (ไม่ค้าง)
    -- aoeParts: list ของ AoE parts จริง (ถ้ามี → หลบออกจากรัศมี AoE)
    H.performBossDodge = function(bossRoot, myRoot, hitboxY, skillEntry, aoeParts)
        if S.BossDodgeBusy then return end
        local dodgePos, modeName = H.chooseDodgePosition(bossRoot, myRoot.Position, hitboxY, skillEntry, aoeParts)
        if not dodgePos then return end

        S.BossDodgeBusy = true
        local aoeCount = aoeParts and #aoeParts or 0
        log(("Boss Dodge: %s (HitboxY=%d AOE=%d) -> %s"):format(
            skillEntry and skillEntry.ModuleName or "?", hitboxY, aoeCount, modeName))

        -- ไม่หยุด hover lock และไม่หยุด attack — หลบเป็นแค่ movement
        -- ยังตี M1 ได้ตลอด และ hover จะกลับตำแหน่งปกติเองหลัง holdTime

        -- ฟังก์ชันหันหน้าไปหาบอส + ตี M1
        local function faceAndAttackBoss()
            if not bossRoot or not bossRoot.Parent then return end
            if not myRoot or not myRoot.Parent then return end
            pcall(function()
                -- หันหน้าไปหาบอส (look at boss)
                local bossPos = bossRoot.Position
                local myPos = myRoot.Position
                local lookDir = bossPos - myPos
                if lookDir.Magnitude > 0.1 then
                    lookDir = lookDir.Unit
                    -- ตั้ง CFrame หันไปหาบอส แต่ยังอยู่ที่ตำแหน่งหลบ
                    myRoot.CFrame = CFrame.new(myPos, Vector3.new(bossPos.X, myPos.Y, bossPos.Z))
                end
            end)
            -- ยิง M1 ไปที่บอส (respect AutoM1 toggle like every other mode)
            if not rAttack then H.refreshCombatRemotes() end
            if CFG.AutoM1 and rAttack and bossRoot and bossRoot.Parent then
                pcall(function()
                    local bossPos = bossRoot.Position
                    local myPos = myRoot.Position
                    local dir = bossPos - myPos
                    if dir.Magnitude > 0.1 then
                        dir = dir / dir.Magnitude
                        if dir.X ~= dir.X or dir.Y ~= dir.Y or dir.Z ~= dir.Z then
                            dir = Vector3.new(0, -1, 0)
                        end
                        rAttack:FireServer(dir)
                        S._lastCombatAct = tick()
                    end
                end)
            end
            -- ใช้สกิลด้วยถ้าเปิดอยู่
            if CFG.AutoSkillEnabled and bossRoot and bossRoot.Parent then
                pcall(function()
                    local bossPos = bossRoot.Position
                    local myPos = myRoot.Position
                    local dir = bossPos - myPos
                    if dir.Magnitude > 0.1 then
                        dir = dir / dir.Magnitude
                        if dir.X == dir.X and dir.Y == dir.Y and dir.Z == dir.Z then
                            H.trySkill(dir)
                        end
                    end
                end)
            end
        end

        -- บินไปตำแหน่งหลบ (lerp ทีละสเต็ป — นุ่มกว่าวาร์ปทันที แต่ยังเร็ว)
        local dodgeStartPos = myRoot.Position
        local dodgeDist = (dodgePos - dodgeStartPos).Magnitude
        local dodgeSteps = math.max(3, math.min(8, math.ceil(dodgeDist / 8)))
        task.spawn(function()
            for i = 1, dodgeSteps do
                if not S.Running or not S.BossDodgeBusy then break end
                if not myRoot or not myRoot.Parent then break end
                local t = i / dodgeSteps
                local pos = dodgeStartPos:Lerp(dodgePos, t)
                pcall(function()
                    myRoot.CFrame = CFrame.new(pos)
                    myRoot.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                    myRoot.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                end)
                task.wait(0.02)
            end
        end)
        -- รอในตำแหน่งหลบ (หลบอย่างเดียว — ไม่ตี ไม่สกิล ตามที่ user ขอ)
        local holdTime = CFG.BossDodgeHoldTime or 1.2
        local elapsed = 0
        while elapsed < holdTime do
            if not S.Running then break end
            -- ถ้าบอสตายหรือหายไป -> กลับทันที
            if not bossRoot or not bossRoot.Parent then break end
            task.wait(0.1)
            elapsed = elapsed + 0.1
            -- อัปเดตตำแหน่งหลบ: ถ้ายังมี AoE ให้คำนวณใหม่ (AoE อาจเคลื่อน)
            pcall(function()
                -- หา AoE ใหม่ถ้ายังมี
                local newAoe = aoeParts
                if aoeCount > 0 then
                    newAoe = H.findAOEParts(bossRoot.Parent, bossRoot)
                end
                local newPos, _ = H.chooseDodgePosition(bossRoot, myRoot.Position, hitboxY, skillEntry, newAoe)
                if newPos and (newPos - dodgePos).Magnitude > 5 then
                    dodgePos = newPos
                    -- บินไปตำแหน่งหลบใหม่ (lerp ทีละสเต็ป — ไม่วาร์ปทันที)
                    local updStart = myRoot.Position
                    local updDist = (dodgePos - updStart).Magnitude
                    local updSteps = math.max(2, math.min(5, math.ceil(updDist / 10)))
                    for i = 1, updSteps do
                        if not S.Running or not myRoot or not myRoot.Parent then break end
                        local t = i / updSteps
                        local pos = updStart:Lerp(dodgePos, t)
                        pcall(function()
                            myRoot.CFrame = CFrame.new(pos)
                            myRoot.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                            myRoot.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                        end)
                        task.wait(0.02)
                    end
                end
            end)
        end

        S.BossDodgeBusy = false
    end

    -- Auto Boss Dodge Scanner: background thread ที่สแกนบอสและหลบสกิล
    -- ใช้ liveEnemies (เหมือน Auto M1) + detectBossSkill (AOE/attribute/animation)
    local bossDodgeScannerThread = nil
    local bossDodgeLastDodge = 0
    local bossDodgeSkillMap = nil  -- cached skill map for current boss
    local bossDodgeBossName = nil

    function startBossDodgeScanner()
        if bossDodgeScannerThread then
            log("Boss Dodge: scanner already running")
            return
        end
        log(("Boss Dodge: scanner started (Running=%s BossRushMode=%s inRun=%s)"):format(
            tostring(S.Running), tostring(S.BossRushMode), tostring(inRun())))
        local scanCount = 0
        bossDodgeScannerThread = task.spawn(function()
            while S.Running do
                if CFG.AutoBossDodge and not S.BossDodgeBusy and not S.KeyCollectBusy then
                    local r = hrp()
                    if r then
                        local myPos = r.Position
                        local now = tick()
                        scanCount = scanCount + 1
                        -- หาบอส: ใน Boss Rush ใช้ findBossRushBoss() (ระบบเดียวกับ bossRushLoop)
                        -- นอก Boss Rush ใช้ H.findBossFromLiveEnemies() (ระบบเดียวกับ Auto M1)
                        local boss = nil
                        if S.BossRushMode then
                            pcall(function() boss = findBossRushBoss() end)
                        else
                            boss = H.findBossFromLiveEnemies()
                        end
                        if boss then
                            -- Log ทุก 25 scans (~3 วินาที) เพื่อไม่ spam
                            if scanCount % 25 == 1 then
                                log(("Boss Dodge: boss found = %s (dist=%d)"):format(
                                    boss.Model.Name,
                                    math.floor((boss.Root.Position - myPos).Magnitude)))
                            end
                            -- สร้าง skill map ถ้ายังไม่มี หรือเปลี่ยนบอสแล้ว
                            if boss.Model.Name ~= bossDodgeBossName then
                                bossDodgeBossName = boss.Model.Name
                                bossDodgeSkillMap = H.buildBossSkillMap(bossDodgeBossName)
                                if bossDodgeSkillMap and next(bossDodgeSkillMap) then
                                    local cnt = 0
                                    for _ in pairs(bossDodgeSkillMap) do cnt = cnt + 1 end
                                    log(("Boss Dodge: tracking %s (%d skills)"):format(bossDodgeBossName, cnt))
                                else
                                    log("Boss Dodge: no skill map for " .. tostring(bossDodgeBossName) .. " — using AOE detection only")
                                end
                                -- DIAGNOSTIC: dump boss model structure ครั้งแรก
                                task.spawn(function()
                                    log("Boss Dodge: DIAGNOSTIC — dumping boss model descendants:")
                                    local count = 0
                                    for _, desc in ipairs(boss.Model:GetDescendants()) do
                                        if desc:IsA("BasePart") then
                                            count = count + 1
                                            if count <= 30 then
                                                local attrs = {}
                                                pcall(function()
                                                    for name, val in pairs(desc:GetAttributes()) do
                                                        table.insert(attrs, name .. "=" .. tostring(val))
                                                    end
                                                end)
                                                local attrStr = #attrs > 0 and (" attrs=[" .. table.concat(attrs, ",") .. "]") or ""
                                                log(("Boss Dodge: DIAG part %s (T=%.2f)%s"):format(desc.Name, desc.Transparency, attrStr))
                                            end
                                        end
                                    end
                                    log(("Boss Dodge: DIAG Total BaseParts: %d"):format(count))
                                    -- ตรวจ workspace.SpellTelegraphs
                                    local st = workspace:FindFirstChild("SpellTelegraphs")
                                    if st then
                                        local stCount = 0
                                        for _, c in ipairs(st:GetDescendants()) do
                                            if c:IsA("BasePart") then stCount = stCount + 1 end
                                        end
                                        log(("Boss Dodge: DIAG SpellTelegraphs: %d parts"):format(stCount))
                                    else
                                        log("Boss Dodge: DIAG SpellTelegraphs: NOT FOUND")
                                    end
                                end)
                            end

                            -- ตรวจระยะ
                            local dist = (boss.Root.Position - myPos).Magnitude
                            if dist <= (CFG.BossDodgeRange or 60) then
                                -- ตรวจสัญญาณสกิล (คืน aoeParts ด้วย)
                                local isCasting, hasAOE, hitboxY, aoeParts = H.detectBossSkill(boss, bossDodgeSkillMap)
                                -- Log debug ทุก 25 scans ว่า detection เจออะไร
                                if scanCount % 25 == 1 then
                                    log(("Boss Dodge: detect -> casting=%s AOE=%s Y=%d aoeParts=%d"):format(
                                        tostring(isCasting), tostring(hasAOE), hitboxY,
                                        aoeParts and #aoeParts or 0))
                                end
                                -- ถ้ากำลังหลบอยู่ (BossDodgeBusy) ไม่ต้องหลบซ้ำ
                                -- ถ้าเพิ่งหลบไป ต้องรอ cooldown
                                -- หลบเฉพาะเมื่อมี AoE วงกลมเท่านั้น (ไม่หลบ Line/ทางตรง)
                                local cooldown = 3.0
                                if hasAOE and isCasting and not S.BossDodgeBusy and (now - bossDodgeLastDodge) >= cooldown then
                                    -- ถ้า mode = Above และอยู่สูงพอแล้ว ไม่ต้องหลบซ้ำ
                                    -- แต่ถ้า mode อื่น (Under/Side/Behind/etc) หลบเสมอเมื่อเจอสกิล
                                    local mode = CFG.BossDodgeMode or "Auto"
                                    local skipDodge = false
                                    if mode == "Above" then
                                        local yDiff = myPos.Y - boss.Root.Position.Y
                                        local safeHeight = S.BossRushMode and (CFG.BossRushAttackHeight or 12.0) or (CFG.AboveHeight or 8.0)
                                        if yDiff >= safeHeight and not hasAOE then
                                            skipDodge = true
                                        end
                                    end
                                    if not skipDodge then
                                        bossDodgeLastDodge = now
                                        local yDiff = myPos.Y - boss.Root.Position.Y
                                        log(("Boss Dodge: skill detected (AOE=%s Y=%d dist=%d yDiff=%d mode=%s aoeParts=%d) -> dodging"):format(
                                            tostring(hasAOE), hitboxY, math.floor(dist), math.floor(yDiff), mode,
                                            aoeParts and #aoeParts or 0))
                                        task.spawn(function()
                                            H.performBossDodge(boss.Root, r, hitboxY, nil, aoeParts)
                                        end)
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        else
                            -- ไม่เจอบอส — ไม่ reset bossDodgeBossName (ป้องกัน setupBossTracking ถูกเรียกซ้ำ)
                            -- Log ทุก 50 scans (~12 วินาที) เพื่อ debug
                            if scanCount % 50 == 1 then
                                log("Boss Dodge: no boss found (scan #" .. scanCount .. ")")
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
                task.wait(0.25)  -- scan interval (ช้าลงเพื่อลดกระตุก)
            end
            -- Loop จบแล้ว — clear thread เพื่อให้เริ่มใหม่ได้
            bossDodgeScannerThread = nil
            log("Boss Dodge: scanner loop ended")
        end)
    end

    function stopBossDodgeScanner()
        if bossDodgeScannerThread then
            pcall(function() task.cancel(bossDodgeScannerThread) end)
            bossDodgeScannerThread = nil
        end
    end



    -- == Universal Telegraph Dodge (Raid Bomb Evasion & Collision Overhaul) ==
    local telegraphDodgeThread = nil
    local dodgeHistory = {}
    local explosionCache = {} -- Stores recent explosion centers: {pos = Vector3, expires = number}

    H.scanAllHazards = function()
        local r = hrp()
        if not r then return {}, {} end
        local myPos = r.Position
        local threats = {}
        local allHazards = {}
        local seen = {}
        local now = tick()

        -- Clean up expired explosions
        for i = #explosionCache, 1, -1 do
            if now > explosionCache[i].expires then
                table.remove(explosionCache, i)
            end
        end
        -- Add cached explosions to hazards
        for _, exp in ipairs(explosionCache) do
            local hazard = { Pos = exp.pos, Radius = exp.radius, Dist = (Vector3.new(myPos.X, 0, myPos.Z) - Vector3.new(exp.pos.X, 0, exp.pos.Z)).Magnitude }
            table.insert(allHazards, hazard)
            if hazard.Dist <= hazard.Radius + 12 then
                table.insert(threats, hazard)
            end
        end

        local function checkPart(child)
            pcall(function()
                if not child or not child:IsA("BasePart") or not child.Parent then return end
                if seen[child] then return end
                seen[child] = true

                local n = (child.Name or ""):lower()
                -- False-positive guards: "DamageDisplay" = floating damage-number parts
                -- (spawn on every hit), "Damage_Crystal" = raid target object — NOT hazards
                if n:find("damagedisplay") or n:find("damage_display") or n:find("damagenumber")
                    or n:find("damage_counter") or (n:find("damage") and n:find("crystal")) then
                    return
                end
                local isHazard = false

                -- Name-based detection
                if n:find("telegraph") or n:find("aoe") or n:find("grenade") or n:find("bomb") or n:find("explosion") or
                   n:find("ring") or n:find("warning") or n:find("indicator") or n:find("circle") or n:find("hazard") or
                   n:find("sigil") or n:find("impact") or n:find("crater") or n:find("blast") or n:find("zone") or
                   n:find("spell") or n:find("oblivion") or n:find("nightfall") or n:find("damage") then
                    isHazard = true
                end

                -- Parts inside a crystal-named ancestor (Damage_Crystal model) are raid
                -- targets, not hazards — without this the dodge loop fights the farm loop
                if isHazard then
                    local anc, depth = child.Parent, 0
                    while anc and anc ~= workspace and depth < 6 do
                        local an = anc.Name and anc.Name:lower() or ""
                        if an:find("crystal") then isHazard = false break end
                        anc = anc.Parent
                        depth = depth + 1
                    end
                end

                -- Visual warning detection (Orange/Red)
                if not isHazard and child.Transparency < 0.95 then
                    local c = child.Color
                    if (c.R > 0.65 and c.B < 0.38 and c.G < 0.8) or (c.R > 0.8 and c.G < 0.35) then
                        local shape = child.Shape
                        -- Usually telegraphs are cylinders or flat blocks
                        if shape == Enum.PartType.Cylinder or (shape == Enum.PartType.Block and child.Size.Y < 2) then
                            isHazard = true
                        end
                    end
                end

                if isHazard and child.Transparency < 0.95 then
                    local sx, sz = child.Size.X, child.Size.Z
                    local radius = math.max(sx, sz) * 0.5
                    if radius < 2 then radius = 12 end
                    
                    -- Cache bombs/explosions
                    if n:find("bomb") or n:find("grenade") or n:find("explosion") then
                        local cached = false
                        for _, exp in ipairs(explosionCache) do
                            if (exp.pos - child.Position).Magnitude < 5 then cached = true break end
                        end
                        if not cached then
                            table.insert(explosionCache, { pos = child.Position, radius = radius, expires = now + 1.2 })
                        end
                    end

                    local dist = (Vector3.new(child.Position.X, 0, child.Position.Z) - Vector3.new(myPos.X, 0, myPos.Z)).Magnitude
                    local hazardObj = { Part = child, Pos = child.Position, Radius = radius, Dist = dist }
                    table.insert(allHazards, hazardObj)
                    
                    if dist <= radius + 12 then
                        table.insert(threats, hazardObj)
                    end
                end
            end)
        end

        -- Scan SpellTelegraphs
        local st = workspace:FindFirstChild("SpellTelegraphs")
        if st then
            for _, child in ipairs(st:GetDescendants()) do checkPart(child) end
        end

        -- Scan workspace directly
        for _, child in ipairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do
            checkPart(child)
            if child:IsA("Folder") or child:IsA("Model") then
                for _, desc in ipairs(child:GetChildren()) do checkPart(desc) end
            end
        end
        
        -- Scan Boss if exists (some bombs are inside boss model)
        if S.CurrentBoss and S.CurrentBoss.Model then
            for _, child in ipairs(S.CurrentBoss.Model:GetDescendants()) do checkPart(child) end
        end

        return threats, allHazards
    end

    local function getDodgeIgnoreList()
        local list = {}
        if LP.Character then table.insert(list, LP.Character) end
        local st = workspace:FindFirstChild("SpellTelegraphs")
        if st then table.insert(list, st) end
        local deb = workspace:FindFirstChild("Debris")
        if deb then table.insert(list, deb) end
        if S.CurrentBoss and S.CurrentBoss.Model then
            table.insert(list, S.CurrentBoss.Model)
        end
        return list
    end

    local function getFloorHeight(pos)
        local found = false
        local floorY = 0
        pcall(function()
            local rayParams = RaycastParams.new()
            rayParams.FilterType = Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude
            rayParams.FilterDescendantsInstances = getDodgeIgnoreList()
            local ray = workspace:Raycast(pos + Vector3.new(0, 4, 0), Vector3.new(0, -50, 0), rayParams)
            if ray then
                found = true
                floorY = ray.Position.Y
            end
        end)
        return found, floorY
    end

    -- Like getFloorHeight but rejects "floors" that sit >8 studs above refY -
    -- those are roofs/ledges, not the ground we should dodge onto.
    local function getGroundFloor(pos, refY)
        local found, y = getFloorHeight(pos)
        if not found then return false, 0 end
        if refY and y > refY + 8 then return false, 0 end
        return true, y
    end

    local function hasClearLOS(startPos, endPos)
        local clear = true
        pcall(function()
            local rayParams = RaycastParams.new()
            rayParams.FilterType = Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude
            rayParams.FilterDescendantsInstances = getDodgeIgnoreList()
            local s = Vector3.new(startPos.X, startPos.Y + 2, startPos.Z)
            local e = Vector3.new(endPos.X, endPos.Y + 2, endPos.Z)
            local dir = e - s
            local ray = workspace:Raycast(s, dir, rayParams)
            if ray then clear = false end
        end)
        return clear
    end

    local function checkWallClearance(pos)
        local safe = true
        pcall(function()
            local rayParams = RaycastParams.new()
            rayParams.FilterType = Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude
            rayParams.FilterDescendantsInstances = getDodgeIgnoreList()
            local dirs = {
                Vector3.new(4.5, 0, 0), Vector3.new(-4.5, 0, 0),
                Vector3.new(0, 0, 4.5), Vector3.new(0, 0, -4.5)
            }
            local p = Vector3.new(pos.X, pos.Y + 2, pos.Z)
            for _, dir in ipairs(dirs) do
                if workspace:Raycast(p, dir, rayParams) then
                    safe = false
                    break
                end
            end
        end)
        return safe
    end

    local function chooseBestDodgePosition(myPos, allHazards)
        local bestPos = nil
        local bestScore = -math.huge
        local _bf, baseFloorY = getFloorHeight(myPos)
        local rings = {15, 26, 38}
        local angles = 16
        
        local candidates = {myPos}
        
        for _, r in ipairs(rings) do
            for a = 1, angles do
                local rad = (math.pi * 2 / angles) * a
                local tryPos = myPos + Vector3.new(math.cos(rad) * r, 0, math.sin(rad) * r)
                table.insert(candidates, tryPos)
            end
        end

        for _, cand in ipairs(candidates) do
            local isSafe = true
            local minHazardDist = math.huge
            for _, haz in ipairs(allHazards) do
                local d = Vector3.new(cand.X - haz.Pos.X, 0, cand.Z - haz.Pos.Z).Magnitude
                if d < haz.Radius + 8 then
                    isSafe = false
                    break
                end
                if d < minHazardDist then minHazardDist = d end
            end

            if isSafe then
                local hasFloor, floorY = getGroundFloor(cand, baseFloorY)
                if hasFloor then
                    local targetPos = Vector3.new(cand.X, floorY, cand.Z)
                    if hasClearLOS(myPos, targetPos) and checkWallClearance(targetPos) then
                        local score = minHazardDist * 2.0
                        local centerDist = Vector3.new(cand.X, 0, cand.Z).Magnitude
                        score = score - (centerDist * 0.1)
                        
                        for _, h in ipairs(dodgeHistory) do
                            if (cand - h.pos).Magnitude < 14 then
                                score = score - 50
                            end
                        end
                        
                        if score > bestScore then
                            bestScore = score
                            local hoverHeight = 14.0
                            bestPos = Vector3.new(cand.X, floorY + hoverHeight, cand.Z)
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
        return bestPos
    end

    function startTelegraphDodgeScanner()
        if telegraphDodgeThread then return end
        log("Telegraph Dodge: scanner started")
        telegraphDodgeThread = task.spawn(function()
            local lastThreatTime = 0
            local currentTargetPos = nil
            local stuckCheckPos = nil
            local stuckCheckTime = 0
            local dodgeFloorY = nil  -- real ground level for this dodge (roofs are ignored)

            while S.Running do
                if CFG.AutoTelegraphDodge and not S.KeyCollectBusy then
                    local r = hrp()
                    if r then
                        local now = tick()
                        for i = #dodgeHistory, 1, -1 do
                            if (now - dodgeHistory[i].time) > 5.0 then
                                table.remove(dodgeHistory, i)
                            end
                        end

                        local threats, allHazards = H.scanAllHazards()
                        
                        if #threats > 0 then
                            lastThreatTime = now
                            S.TelegraphDodgeActive = true
                            if not dodgeFloorY then
                                local okF, fy = getFloorHeight(r.Position)
                                dodgeFloorY = okF and fy or (r.Position.Y - 3)
                            end
                            
                            local needNewPos = false
                            if not currentTargetPos then
                                needNewPos = true
                            else
                                for _, haz in ipairs(allHazards) do
                                    local d = Vector3.new(currentTargetPos.X - haz.Pos.X, 0, currentTargetPos.Z - haz.Pos.Z).Magnitude
                                    if d < haz.Radius + 8 then
                                        needNewPos = true
                                        break
                                    end
                                end
                            end

                            if needNewPos then
                                local bestPos = chooseBestDodgePosition(r.Position, allHazards)
                                if bestPos then
                                    currentTargetPos = bestPos
                                    table.insert(dodgeHistory, {pos = bestPos, time = now})
                                else
                                    local hasFloor, floorY = getFloorHeight(r.Position)
                                    if hasFloor then
                                        currentTargetPos = Vector3.new(r.Position.X, floorY + 14, r.Position.Z)
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        end

                        if S.TelegraphDodgeActive and currentTargetPos then
                            pcall(function()
                                local currentPos = r.Position
                                if not stuckCheckPos or (now - stuckCheckTime) > 0.4 then
                                    if stuckCheckPos and (currentPos - stuckCheckPos).Magnitude < 1.0 then
                                        local centerDir = -Vector3.new(currentPos.X, 0, currentPos.Z).Unit
                                        if centerDir.Magnitude < 0.1 then centerDir = Vector3.new(1,0,0) end
                                        currentTargetPos = currentPos + centerDir * 10
                                        local hasFloor, floorY = getGroundFloor(currentTargetPos, dodgeFloorY)
                                        if hasFloor then currentTargetPos = Vector3.new(currentTargetPos.X, floorY + 14, currentTargetPos.Z) end
                                    end
                                    stuckCheckPos = currentPos
                                    stuckCheckTime = now
                                end

                                local stepDir = (currentTargetPos - currentPos)
                                if stepDir.Magnitude > 0.5 then
                                    local maxDist = 80 * 0.05
                                    local actualStep = stepDir
                                    if actualStep.Magnitude > maxDist then
                                        actualStep = actualStep.Unit * maxDist
                                    end
                                    local newPos = currentPos + actualStep
                                    
                                    local hasFloor, floorY = getGroundFloor(newPos, dodgeFloorY)
                                    if hasFloor then
                                        local targetY = math.clamp(newPos.Y, floorY + 10, floorY + 14)
                                        newPos = Vector3.new(newPos.X, targetY, newPos.Z)
                                    end

                                    r.CFrame = CFrame.new(newPos)
                                    r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                                    r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                                else
                                    -- Hold position in the air until dodge duration ends
                                    r.CFrame = CFrame.new(currentTargetPos)
                                    r.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                                    r.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                                end
                            end)
                        end

                        if S.TelegraphDodgeActive and (now - lastThreatTime) > 1.8 then
                            S.TelegraphDodgeActive = false
                            currentTargetPos = nil
                            dodgeFloorY = nil
                        end
                    else
                        S.TelegraphDodgeActive = false
                    end
                else
                    S.TelegraphDodgeActive = false
                    currentTargetPos = nil
                end
                task.wait(0.1)  -- was 0.05 (20Hz hazard scan caused stutter)
            end
            telegraphDodgeThread = nil
            log("Telegraph Dodge: scanner loop ended")
        end)
    end

    function stopTelegraphDodgeScanner()
        if telegraphDodgeThread then
            pcall(function() task.cancel(telegraphDodgeThread) end)
            telegraphDodgeThread = nil
        end
    end

    -- ===================== Global Mob-Stuck Watchdog =====================
    -- While a farm mode is running and the character is inside a run, if it is
    -- not actually farming — standing still, not attacking, no damage/progress —
    -- for CFG.StallTimeout seconds, return to lobby automatically.
    -- Covers every mode (dungeon/endless/challenge/payload/boss rush/raid),
    -- unlike the old dungeon-loop-only watchdog.
    local stuckWatchThread = nil
    H.startStuckWatchdog = function()
        if stuckWatchThread then return end
        log("Mob Stuck watchdog: started")
        stuckWatchThread = task.spawn(function()
            local lastPos = nil
            local lastActive = tick()
            local lastHP = nil
            local lastModel = nil
            local lastInRun = nil
            local function npcFolderActive(name)
                local f = workspace:FindFirstChild(name)
                return f ~= nil and #f:GetChildren() > 0
            end
            -- Mode-agnostic progress scan: any enemy HP drop or a kill (alive
            -- count decrease) across run containers = real farming progress,
            -- even in modes that never set hoverTarget.
            local hpMap = {}
            local lastEnemyCount = nil
            local function enemyProgress()
                local prog = false
                local alive = 0
                local seen = {}
                local roots = {
                    H.dungeonFolder(),
                    workspace:FindFirstChild("Raid_NPCs"),
                    workspace:FindFirstChild("BossRush_NPCs"),
                    H.challengeFolder(),
                    workspace:FindFirstChild("PayloadEnemies", true),
                }
                for _, root in ipairs(roots) do
                    if root then
                        for _, d in ipairs(root:GetDescendants()) do
                            if d:IsA("Humanoid") and d.Health > 0 then
                                alive += 1
                                local prev = hpMap[d]
                                if prev and d.Health < prev then prog = true end
                                hpMap[d] = d.Health
                                seen[d] = true
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
                for k in pairs(hpMap) do if not seen[k] then hpMap[k] = nil end end
                if lastEnemyCount and alive < lastEnemyCount then prog = true end
                lastEnemyCount = alive
                return prog
            end
            while true do
                task.wait(1)
                local okW, errW = pcall(function()
                -- Fallback: a live hover target means we're in a run even if every
                -- folder/attribute check missed (raid arenas, unloaded maps, etc.)
                local hasTarget = hoverTarget and hoverTarget.Model and hoverTarget.Model.Parent ~= nil
                local inAnyRun = inRun()
                    or S.BossRushMode or S.RaidMode
                    or LP:GetAttribute("InDungeon") and true
                    or LP:GetAttribute("InBossRush") and true
                    or LP:GetAttribute("InRaid") and true
                    or npcFolderActive("Raid_NPCs")
                    or npcFolderActive("BossRush_NPCs")
                    or hasTarget
                -- Log state transitions + what each signal sees (once, no spam)
                if inAnyRun ~= lastInRun then
                    lastInRun = inAnyRun
                    log(("Mob Stuck: in-run=%s (inRun=%s InDungeon=%s InBossRush=%s InRaid=%s BRmode=%s RaidMode=%s raidNPCs=%s brNPCs=%s target=%s)"):format(
                        tostring(inAnyRun), tostring(inRun()),
                        tostring(LP:GetAttribute("InDungeon")),
                        tostring(LP:GetAttribute("InBossRush")),
                        tostring(LP:GetAttribute("InRaid")),
                        tostring(S.BossRushMode), tostring(S.RaidMode),
                        tostring(npcFolderActive("Raid_NPCs")),
                        tostring(npcFolderActive("BossRush_NPCs")),
                        tostring(hasTarget)))
                end
                if not inAnyRun then
                    -- Lobby / between runs — reset baseline, never trigger here
                    lastActive = tick()
                    lastPos = nil
                    lastModel = nil
                    if S.MobStuckLabel then
                        pcall(function() S.MobStuckLabel:SetText("Mob Stuck: idle (lobby)") end)
                    end
                else
                    local now = tick()
                    -- Signal 1: character moved (>4 studs since last check)
                    local moved = false
                    local r = hrp()
                    if r then
                        if lastPos and (r.Position - lastPos).Magnitude > 4 then moved = true end
                        lastPos = r.Position
                    end
                    -- Signal 2: progress — target switched (a kill) or its HP dropped
                    local progress = false
                    local tgtModel = hoverTarget and hoverTarget.Model
                    if tgtModel ~= lastModel then
                        lastModel = tgtModel
                        lastHP = nil
                        if tgtModel then progress = true end
                    elseif tgtModel and tgtModel.Parent then
                        local h = tgtModel:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
                        if h then
                            if lastHP and h.Health < lastHP then progress = true end
                            lastHP = h.Health
                        end
                    end
                    -- Fallback: scan enemy containers for damage/kills — covers
                    -- modes that never set hoverTarget (raid, payload, etc.)
                    if not progress then
                        progress = enemyProgress()
                    end
                    -- Combat activity: M1/skill fired in the last 3s, or a dodge /
                    -- key-collect is running — the bot is actively working even if
                    -- no damage registers (boss i-frames, telegraph phase, etc.)
                    local combatAct = S._lastCombatAct and (now - S._lastCombatAct) < 3
                    local dodgeAct = S.TelegraphDodgeActive or S.BossDodgeBusy or S.KeyCollectBusy
                    -- Payload boat rides are legitimate long waits — no combat
                    -- happens while sailing to the next checkpoint.
                    local waiting = H.inPayload() and H.payloadOnBoat()
                    -- Movement only counts while hunting (no target yet). When a
                    -- target is locked, circling/warping without damage IS stuck —
                    -- the hover system moves the character even when nothing works.
                    local farming = progress or waiting or combatAct or dodgeAct
                        or (moved and not tgtModel)
                    if farming then
                        lastActive = now
                    end
                    -- Countdown status for UI: time left until auto return-to-lobby
                    if S.MobStuckLabel then
                        local labelTxt
                        if not CFG.MobStuckReturn then
                            labelTxt = "Mob Stuck: OFF"
                        elseif waiting then
                            labelTxt = "Mob Stuck: waiting (payload boat)"
                        elseif farming then
                            labelTxt = ("Mob Stuck: farming (%ds)"):format(CFG.StallTimeout or 60)
                        else
                            local remain = math.max(0, (CFG.StallTimeout or 60) - (now - lastActive))
                            labelTxt = ("Mob Stuck: STUCK - return lobby in %ds"):format(math.ceil(remain))
                        end
                        pcall(function() S.MobStuckLabel:SetText(labelTxt) end)
                    end
                    if not farming and CFG.MobStuckReturn
                        and (now - lastActive) > (CFG.StallTimeout or 60) then
                        log(("Mob Stuck: no farm activity for %ds -> returning to lobby"):format(
                            CFG.StallTimeout or 60))
                        pcall(H.returnToLobby)
                        task.wait(8)  -- let the return go through before re-checking
                        lastActive = tick()
                        lastPos = nil
                        lastModel = nil
                    end
                end
                end)
                if not okW then
                    log("Mob Stuck watchdog error: " .. tostring(errW))
                    task.wait(2)
                end
            end
        end)
    end

